<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbui Yedi inga yekuandikwavyo ni Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbui Yedi inga yekuandikwavyo ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Uwoongoezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbui Yedi inga yekuandikwavyo ni Yohana ni mwenga ya vitabu vine he agane dihya ambado datamwiiza wekazi wa Yesu Klistu. Kiya kimwe gatigati ya vitabu ivyo vyetangwa Injili mana yakwe, Mbui Yedi, viandikwa ni Matayo, na Maliko, Luka, na Yohana bada ya ufe wa Yesu. Mbui Yedi yekuandikwayo ni Yohana yadahika kiandikwa ni mwagiiwa Yohana, mwe myaka makumi kenda bada ya ufe wa Klistu. Etiho kitabu khakigombeka inga Yohana nee mwekuandika, akini viya chekuandikwavyo chaigana na bauwa ya bosi ya Yohana, bauwa ya kaidi ya Yohana, na bauwa ya ntatu ya Yohana, yamwe ya maandiko yagombeka kuwa Yohana nee akekaa mzi wa Efeso he kisingi icho, kwa ivyo yadahika kitabu kiandikwa uko Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana kaika pwii kuwa nia ya kitabu ni kuwaambiza wantu kuzumiia kuwa Yesu nee Klistu na Mwana wa Muungu mwenye ugima 20:31. Kwa kuzumiia ivi tinao ugima kwembokea zina dakwe. Kitabu iki nee kiandikwa ili kisomwe na Wayahudi wose na wesao kuwa Wayahudi. Mbui Yedi ya Yohana kwasia ntuhu iandikwa khaigana na vitabu vituhu vitatu vya Mbui Yedi, Yohana katamwiizia muno vihii vyekugosolwavyo ni Yesu, akini khekuandika misimo mingi ekugosoayo Yesu. Mbui khuu ntuhu za Yesu inga viya ubatiizo wa Yesu na kugeezwa kwa Yesu he kiwawe navyo khavyekuandikwa mwe Mbui Yedi inu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeumondani</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana avoka kuandika Mbui Yedi, mwe chando cha 1:1-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Naho aandika vihii ekugosoavyo Yesu, mwe chando cha 1:19, 12:50.</para>
  <para style="io">Akatongea kutamwiiza yekulawiiayo mangi yahusuyo wekazi wa Yesu adi ufe wakwe na kuyuyuka kwakwe, mwe chando cha 13:1, 20:31.</para>
  <para style="io1">Yohana abindiizia kuandika kitabu cha Mbui Yedi inu mwe chando cha 21 atamwiiza he kisingi ambaho Yesu eaviiza kwa wantu bada ya kuyuyuka kwakwe naho atamwiiya nia yakwe ya kuandika kitabu iki.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Mbui ya ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Aho bosi inusi khaizati kuubwa, nee kuwa na Mbui, naye Mbui nee akawa kwa Muungu, naye Mbui ni Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kuvokea aho bosi uyo Mbui nee kawa hamwe na Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Kwembokea yee vintu vyose viumbwa, khahana ata kintu kimwe chekugosokacho kwesiho yee. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Na Mbui nekawa vokeo da ugima na ugima unu ueta ung'azi kwa wantu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ung'azi uwo waangaza mwe kiza, naho kiza khachekudaha kuuvota.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Muungu akamwaagiiya mntu yumwe etangwaye Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Uyo keza kuwavuhuzia wantu kuusu uwo ung'azi kuwa kia mtu adahe kutegeeza mbui iyo na kuzumiia. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yohana khekuwa uwo ung'azi, iya keza kuwavuhuzia wantu kuusu uwo ung'azi. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Unu nee ung'azi wa kwei, ung'azi wezao mwe inusi na kuwaangaza wantu wose.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Naho iyo Mbui ekuwaho mwe inusi, kwembokea yee inusi igosolwa, akini wantu wa inusi khawekummanya. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Yee keza he si yakwe mwenye, akini wantu wekuawo wa kwakwe khawekumhokea. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Akini wada wekumhokeao, na kumzumiia, akawekha udaho wa kuwa wana wa Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Awa nee wekuvyaigwao khio kwa phome nawala kwa mwii hambu akundavyo mntu iya kwaakundavyo Muungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Naye uyo Mbui kawa mntu akekaa hamwe na swie, swie tiona ukuu wakwe, ukuu ekuuhokeao inga mwana wa ikedu, ekulawaye kwa Tate kamema wedi na ukwei.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana kawavuhuzia wantu mbui zakwe, akagombeka kwa mgutio, “Uyu nee yuda nekumtamwiiaye mbui zakwe nikigombeka, ‘Yee ezae hemgongo wangu ni mkuu kusima mie, kwaviya kawa aho kisingi khizati kuvyaigwa.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kulawana na wingi wa wedi wakwe swie wose, tihokea majaiwa uwanga ya majaiwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Muungu katekha miagiiyo kwembokea Musa, akini wedi na kwei vitezea kwembokea kwa Yesu Klistu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Khahana mntu mwekumuona Muungu katu iya Mwana ikedu mwekuigana na Muungu, yee ekuwae hehi na Tate, nee mwe kutigubuiya mbui za Muungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbui ya Yohana Mbatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ivi nee ekuvuhuziavyo Yohana kisingi waongoezi wa Kiyahudi kuda Yelusalemu wekuwagiiyaho waviki, na Walawi, wamuuze Yohana Wee u ndai?<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana khekuemea kutambaisa mbui iyo, akini akatamwiiya pwii akamba, “Miye khio Klistu mwekusagulwaye ni Muungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Wakamuuza, “Wee u ndai? Wee ni Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yee akawatambaisa, “Aaha miye khiye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wakamuuza vituhu, “Wee ni yuda muoni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana akawatambaisa, aaha miye khiye.<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Nawo wakamwamba, asa wee u ndai? Takundigwa tivuze ntambaisi kwa wada wekutiagiiyao, isasa tambie wee u ndai?<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana akawatambaisa miye ni yuda ambae Muoni Isaya kagombeka mbui zakwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Mgutio wa mntu wetanga mwenyika ‘Mgosoeyani Zumbe sia yakwe Nyooshani myemboko yakwe.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Awo wantu nee waagiiwa ni Mafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />naho wakamuuza Yohana, “Ati wee khiwe Klistu, wala khiyo Eliya, wala khiyo yumwe wa muoni, kwa mbwai wabatiiza?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana akawatambaisa, “Miye nabatiiza kwa mazi, akini gatigati yenu hana yumwe mwesae kummanya. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Miye khiongoa iya endaye eze miye khifaa katu kumchopoa sigi za sabana yakwe.”<figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">Mntu avaa sabana</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Vintu ivi vyose vigosoka uko Besaniya he phande za awiyo da zua he zigizigi da mazi ya Yolodani aho ekuwaho Yohana nee abatiizaho.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanangoto wa Muungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Kioi yakwe Yohana kamuona Yesu akimwezea akagombeka, “Kauwani, uyu nee mwanangoto wa Muungu, adoaye mavigaviga ya wantu wa mweinusi. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Uyu ni yuda nekumtamwiiaye nekugombekaho, ‘Kuna mntu mwezae he mgongo wangu, akini ni mkuu kusima miye kwaviya kawa aho kisingi miye khizati kuvyaigwa.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Miye ncheekummanya eivyo, akini ncheza kubatiiza kwa mazi ili wantu wa Isilaeli wadahe kummanya.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Naho Yohana akawekha uvuhuzi na kugombeka, “Kimwona Muye ukaseeya inga sua kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu na kwekaa uwanga yakwe.” <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Miye ncheekummanya kuwa ni yee, akini Muungu ekuniagiiyae kubatiiza wantu kwa mazi nekanamba, “Mntu yuda wendaeumwone Muye wa Muungu akaseeya kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu na kwekaa uwanga yakwe uyo nee endaeabatize kwa Muye wangu miye Muungu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Yohana akaendeea kugombeka, “Miye khivuhuzia na nawamba kwei uyu ni Mwana wa Muungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahina wa bosi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Kioi dakwe, Yohana kagooka hada vituhu hamwe na wahina wakwe waidi. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Ekumuonaho Yesu emboka akamba, “Kauwani! Uyu ni Mwanangoto wa Muungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Wada wahina waidi wekutegezaho akigombeka ayo wakambasa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu ekuhitukaho, na kuwaona wada wahina wambasa, akawauza, “Mwaondeza mbwai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Wakamtambaisa, “Labbi” mana yakwe Mhinyi, wekaa kuhi.<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Nee iwa inga saa kumi guoni Yesu akawamba “Sooni mkauwe.” Aho wahina wakambasa, wakoona hantu ekuwaho akekaa wakasinda naye msi uwo wose.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Yumwe yao nee kawa Andulea nduguye Simoni Petulo, nee kawa wao wa wada waidi wekumtegeezao Yohana akagombeka ivyo na wakamtongea Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Ahoaho Andulea akaita kumwamba nduguye Simoni, “Timuona Masiya mana yakwe Yesu Klistu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Naye akamwegaa Simoni kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu akamkauwa Simoni akamwamba, “Wee zina dako ni Simoni mwana wa Yohana. Isasa wendawetangwe Kefa” Kigiiki ni Petulo mana yakwe “Iwe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awetanga Fiipo na Nasanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Msi wekutongeao Yesu akaamua kuita si ya Galilaya, akamwona Fiipo na akamwamba “Nitongee.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Fiipo nee akawa akalawa Betisaida, mzi wekuwao wakekaa Andulea na Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Na Fiipo akambwiiya Nasanaeli akamwamba, Timuona mntu ambae Musa kaandika mbui zakwe mwe kitabu cha miagiiyo, na ambae waoni waandika mbui zakwe. Yee ni Yesu Mwana wa Yusufu kulawa mzi wa Nazaleti.<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nasanaeli akauza, “Yadahika viivihi vihi kintu chedi kilawe mzi wa Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Fiipo akatambaisa, “Soo na ukauwe”.<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu ekumuonaho Nasanaeli amwezeya akamba, “Kauwani uyo ni Muisilaeli wa kwei khana dosali umo mwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nasanaeli akamuuza kudaha vivihi kunimanya?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu akatambaisa khikuona wekuwaho asi ya mti wetagwaho mtini, kisingi Fiipo khazati kukwetanga.<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Nasanaeli akamtambaisa, “Labbi wee nee Mwana wa Muungu, wee nee Seuta wa Isilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu akamwamba, “Kuzumiiya kwa kuwa kikwamba khikuona asi ya mtini? Wendauone mbui khuu kusima izi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu akawamba, “Nawamba ukwei mwendamuone uwanga kwa Muungu kuvuguka na wandima wa uwanga kwa Muungu wakakwea na kuseeya heuwanga ya Mwana wa Mntu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Wiya mwe mzi wa Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Msi wa ntatu hawa na wiya mwe mzi wa Kana, uko Galilaya, mami yakwe da Yesu naye kawa aho. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu hamwe na wahina wakwe wagonekwa mwe wiya uwo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divai yekusiaho, mami yakwe da Yesu akamwamba, “Khawana divai.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Mmaa usekunamba nigosoe chochose, kisingi changu khakizati kubua.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Mami yakwe da Yesu akawamba wandima, “Dodose endadoawambe gosoani.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Aho hawa na mabiga mtandatu yekugosolwayo kwa maiwe, kia dimwe didahado kwengia ndoo shano za mazi. Nee yaikwa aho kutongeana na mazweeya ya Wayahudi ya kwezingua. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu akawamba wada wandima, memeezani ayo mabiga mazi, nao wakayamemeeza adi uwanga. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Naho akawamba, “Isasa tekani mazi mwe ayo mabiga mmwegaiye Mkuu wa wiya.” Wakadoa yada mazi na kumwegaiya. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Mkuu wa wiya ekusonaho ayo mazi, kumbe nee yahituka kae kutenda divai. Yee khekumanya yekulawiiako, akini wada wandima wekutekao mazi nee wakamanya. Mkuu wa wiya akamwetanga zumbe wa wiya, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />na akamwamba, “Kia mntu avoka kuika divai ntana wantu wakabinda kutosheka nee awekha yesayokuwa ntana muno, akini wee kuiika divai ntana adi isasa!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Unu ni utangio wa bosi wa Yesu ekugosoao uko Kana mzi wa Galilaya, na kugubua Ukuu wakwe, na wahina wakwe wakamzumiiya.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Yekwembokaho ayo Yesu na mami yakwe, hamwe na wanduguze, na wahina wakwe wakaseeya mwe mzi wa Kapelinaumu na wakekaa uko misi micheche.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aita he Nyumba ya Muungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayo 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Sikukhuu ya Wayahudi yetangwayo Pasaka yekuwaho hehi, Yesu akaita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />He ida Nyumba ya Muungu akawabwiiya wantu wataga ng'ombe, na ngoto, na sua na watuhu wekuwao wekaa na kuvunja hea.<figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Watabiashaa wavunja hea</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Ivyo akagosoa mkoto wa uzigi, na kuwaguusa wanyama chongoi he ida Nyumba ya Muungu. Wanyama wose ngoto, na ng'ombe na kuzigwisa meza za wavunja hea na kuzigwisa hea zao. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Akawamba wada wekuawo wakataga sua, “Usani vintu ivi aha, ekani kugosoa Nyumba ya Tate yangu inga gwiiyo.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Wahina wakwe wakayakumbuka yada Maandiko yagombekayo “Ukundiso wangu kwa nyumba yako, Ee Muungu yangu yanoka inga moto.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Waongoezi wa Kiyahudi wakamuuza, “Utangio wani wendao uugosoe kutionyesha ati una udaho wani wakugosoa ivi?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu akawamba, “Bomoani inu Nyumba ya Muungu, nami nendanizenge kwa misi mitatu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Wada Wayahudi wakamuuza, “Nyumba inu ya Muungu izengwa kwa kisingi cha myaka magana mane na mtandatu, nawe wamba wenda uzenge kwa misi mitatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Akini, Nyumba ya Muungu ekuayo akatamwiiya Yesu ni mwii wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Kisingi Yesu ekuyuyukaho, wahina wakwe nee wakumbuka ida Mbui ekutamwiiayo, wakayazumiiya Maandiko ya Muungu, na mbui zose ekugombekazo Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amanya mioyo ya wantu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Akini Yesu ekuaho mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu kwe sikukhuu ya Pasaka wantu wangi wakazumiiya wekuonaho utangio ekugosoao. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Akini Yesu khekuwa na uzumizi nao, kwaajii kamanya mbui zekuwazo mwe mioyo yao. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Khekukunda kuvuhuzia mbui yoyose uwanga ya wantu, kwa viya azimanya mbui zose zeumo ndani ya mioyo yao.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Hawa na muongoezi yumwe wa Kiyahudi zina dakwe Nikodemo, mwekuwa yumwe wamkonga da Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Kio kimwe Nikodemo akaita kwa Yesu na kumwamba, “Labbi, tamanya ati wee ni mhinyi mwekuagiiwa ni Muungu, khahana mntu mdaha kugosoa ntangio uvigosoavyo kwesahokuwa Muungu yu hamwe nae.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Nakugombeka kwei, khahana mwenda adahe kwengia mwe useuta wa Muungu, akese kuvyaigwa maa ya kaidi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo akamuuza, “Mntu mgima adaha viivihi kuvyaigwa vituhu? Ivi adaha kwengia mwe ifu da mamiakwe na kuvyaigwa maa ya kaidi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu akatambaisa, “Nawamba kwei, khahana mntu endae engie mwe Useuta wa Muungu kwesaho kuvyaigwa kwa mazi na kwa Muye wa Muungu.” <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Mntu avyaigwa kimwii kwa tate na mmaa, akini ugosolwa kuwa Mwana wa Muungu na Muye wa Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Usekuhondomaa, kwaajii kikwamba kuwa yakundigwa uvyaigwe maa ya kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Khusi yavuma hohose ikundaho, wategeeza mgutio wakwe, akini khumanya yalawiiya kuhi, na kuhi uitako, nee vyeivyo kwa mntu mwekuvyaigwa kwa Muye wa Muungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo akauza, “Mbui izi zadahika viivihi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Wee ni mhinyi mkuu mwe si ya Isilaeli, yadahika viivihi khuzimanya Mbui izi? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Nakwamba ukwei tatamwiia mbui tizimanyazo na tavuhuzia tekukionacho, akini khahana ata yumwe wenu ambaye azumiiyae kuhokea mahinyo yetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Inga miye khamkunizumiiya niwagombekaho mbui zigosokazo mwe inusi, ivi mwenda mnizumiie nendaho nigombeke mbui za uwanga kwa Muungu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Khahana mwekubua uko uwanga kwa Muungu, iya Mwana wa mntu nee mwekuseeyae kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Inga viya Musa ekumwenuavyo uwanga nyoka wa shaba he kiwawe, nae Mwana wa Mntu endaenulwe uwanga ivyoivyo. <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />Ili kiya mntu amzumiiaye endaawe na ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kwaviya Muungu kaikundisa inusi ata akamlavya mwanawe wa ikedu, ili kia mntu endae amzumiiye asekwaga, iya awe na ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kwaviya Muungu khekumwaagiiya Mwanawe mwe inusi ili awaamuiye wantu, iya wantu waoholwe kwembokea yee.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Wantu wose wamzumiiao Mwana khawana waamuiiwe, akini wose wesao kumzumiia Mwana, waamuiwa kae, kwaajii khawekumzumiiya Mwana wa ikedu wa Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Na uwamuiyo wenye ni unu, ung'azi weza mwe inusi, akini wantu wakakunda kiza kwesima ung'azi, kwaajii ya ntendwa zao ni za ufyaimi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Wose wagosoao yesayokutama, waemea ung'azi, naho khawakunda kweza he ung'azi, kwaviya khawakunda ntendwa zao za fyaimi zioneke pwii. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Akini yoyose mwenye kutoza kwei eza he ung'azi, ili waonyeshe yada wagosoayo kwa kuwa yamtamiza Muungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana Mbatiiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Bada ya aho Yesu na wahina wakwe wakaita mwe si ya Yudea, na kwekaa uko kwa misi micheche na kubatiiza wantu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohana nae nee akabatiiza huko Ainoni, hehi na mzi wa Salimu kwaviya kuwa na mazi mangi, wantu wakamtimia na kuita kubatizwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Aya yalawiiya kisingi Yohana nee khazati kwengizwa mwe kifungo.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Msi umwe wamwe wa wahina wa Yohana wakavoka kuhigana na Myahudi yumwe kwaajii ya kwezingua inga igombekavyo miko kisingi mntu khazati kuvika. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Awo wahina wakambasa Yohana na kumwamba, “Labbi wambukhua mntu yuda wekuae naye phande ya awiyo da zua da Yolodani yuda wekutivuhuziae Mbui zakwe? Isasa naye abatiiza na kiya mntu amtongea.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana akawatambaisa, “Khahana mntu yoyose adahae kuhokea kintu chochose kwesiho kulawa uwanga uko kwa Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Nywie nyose ni wavuhuzi wangu kwakuwa kigombeka, ‘Miye khie Klistu, akini khiagiiwa nimuongwee.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mwai ya kivyee nimai ya mteguzi, akini mbuyaye damteguzi, ambae agooka na kumtegeeza uwa na nyemi muno, ategeezaho mgutio wa mteguzi akamba mbui inu, kwaajii inu nyemi yangu yekuiganiayo. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Yee akundigwa atende mkuu nami nitende mdodo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbui za yee alawaye uwanga kwa Muungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Mwana wa Muungu kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu ni mkuu wa wose, alawaye mwe inusi ni wa inusi, na utamwiiya mbui za mwe inusi. Akini ezaye kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu yu uwanga wa wose. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Yee avuhuzia yada ekuonayo na ekutegeezayo kulawa uwanga uko kwa Muungu, khio wantu wangi wazumiiyao mbui zakwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Akini yoyose avuhuziae mbui zakwe amanya kuwa agombekayo Muungu ni kwei. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Yoyose mwekuagiiwa ni Muungu agombeka mbui za Muungu kwaviya Muungu amwekha Muye wakwe ili amuongoee kwa kia kintu. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tate amkundisa Mwanawe na kamwekha vintu vyose ili avigookee. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Yoyose amzumiiaye Mwana ana ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, yoyose mwesaye kumzumiia Mwana khana awe na ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, akini endaekhigwe suuba ni Muungu misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na mvyee Msamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafalisayo nee wakategeeza kuwa Yesu abatiiza nakupata wahina wangi kusima Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Akini ukwei ni kuwa Yesu khekumbatiza yoyose iya wahina wakwe nee wekuwao wakabatiiza. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yesu ekutegeezayo ayo, akalawa Uyahudi, akauya mwe si ya Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Na mwe ntambo iyo, imkunda embokee mwe si ya Samalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Nee abuwa mwe mzi umwe wa Samalia wetangwao Sikali, hehi ya uda mnda ambaho Yakobo nee kamwekha mwanawe Yusufu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Hantu hada hawa na kisima cha Yakobo, nae Yesu kwa msokeo wa ntambo, akekaa khandakhanda ya kisima, nee iwa musi saa mtandatu.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Keza mvyee yumwe kulawa mwe si ya Samalia keza kuteka mazi, Yesu akamwamba, “Nekha mazi nidomee.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Kisingi icho wahina wakwe nee waita kwe mzi kugua khande.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Akini yuda mvyee akamwamba, weye u Myahudi na miye Msamalia wadaha viivihi kuniombeza mazi? Kwaviya Wayahudi na Wasamalia khawaugusana na khawagosoa chochose kia hamwe.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Ati nee ukamanya kiya ambacho Muungu adaha kukwekha na nndai akwambae, nekha mazi nidomee, wee nee ukamuombeza, naye akakwekha mazi ugima.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Yuda mvyee akamba, “Zumbe wee khuna ugata na kisima ni kileha, ayo mazi ambayo yawekha wantu ugima wenda uyapate hahi?” <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Hambu, wee wetenda mkuu kusima tati yetu Yakobo? Yee mwekutekha swie kisima iki, na yee mwenye, wana wakwe, na mantintimo yakwe, nee wadomea mazi ya kisima iki.<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu akatambaisa, “Kiya mntu endae adomee mazi aya enda atozwe ni khiu vituhu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Akini mwendae adomee mazi nendayo nimwekhe miye, khana atozwe ni khiu vituhu, mazi nendayo nimwekhe yenda yawe ni soko da mazi ya ugima, na yendayoyamwekhe ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi.<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Yuda mvyee akamwamba, “Zumbe nekha mazi ayo nisekweza kutozwa ni khiu vituhu, naho nisekweza aha vituhu kuteka mazi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu akamwamba yuda mvyee, hita ukamwetange muumeo, weze naye aha.<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mvyee yuda akamwamba, miye khina mgosi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu akamwamba, “Kugombeka kwei kuwa khuna mgosi. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kwaviya nee kutegulwa na wagosi washano, na uyu wekae naye isasa khio muumeo, aho kugombeka kwei.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Yuda mvyee akamwamba, “Zumbe naona kuwa wee u muoni.” <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Akaendeea kugombeka, “Baba zetu nee wakamvikia Muungu uwanga ya muima unu, akini nywie Wayahudi mwagombeka hantu ha kumvikia Muungu ni uko Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu akamwamba, “Nizumiiya wee mvyee, kisingi cheza khamna mumvikie Tate uwanga mwe muima unu, hambu kuda Yelusalemu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Nywie Wasamalia, mwamvikia yuda mwesae kummanya, akini swie Wayahudi tamvikia yuda timmanyae, kwaviya uohozi walawiiya kwa Wayahudi <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Kisingi cheza, naho kibua, ambao wantu wakundao kumvikia Muungu mwe ukwei, wendawamvikie Tate inga Muye wakwe endavyo awaonyeshe, kumvika yee eivyo kwei. Tate Muungu awakunda ambao wamvika kwa sia iyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Muungu ni Muye, na wantu wamvikiao wakundigwa wamvikie kwa Muye na kwei.<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Uyo mvyee akamwamba, “Namanya eza Masiya yani Klistu, umo akeza enda atigubwiiye kia kintu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu akamwamba, “Miye nitamwiiaye nawe ndie.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Aho wahina wakwe wakauya, wakamaka koona atamwiiya na mvyee, akini khahana yumwe yao ekumuuzae yuda mvyee, “Waondeza mbwai?” Wala khahana ekumuuzae Yesu, “Kwa mbwai watamwiiya na mvyee?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Yuda mvyee akabada biga dakwe hada, akaita mwe mzi na kuwamba wantu. <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Sooni mumkauwe mntu mwekunamba mbui zangu zose nigosoazo. Ivi, adahika yee nee Klistu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Wantu wakalawa mwe si ya Samalia wakambasa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Kisingi icho wahina wakwe wamuombeza Yesu, “Mhinyi, daa khande.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Akini Yesu akawamba, “Miye nina khande mwesayo kuimanya nywie.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Wahina wakwe wakauzana, “Ivi kuna mntu mwekumweetea khande?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu akamba, khande yangu ni kugosoa akundavyo yuda mwekuniagiiya na kubindiiza ndima ekunekhayo kuigosoa. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Nywie mwagombeka, “Isigaa miongo minne kisingi cha ubosi kibua.” Akini miye nawamba, kauwani minda, khande zidahaa na zihehi kubondwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Mbosi ekhigwa maiho yakwe, na akusanya khande kwaajii ya ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, ivyo mhasi na mbosi, wendawawe na nyemi hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Msimo unu ni kwei, “Yumwe ahanda mtuhu abonda.” <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Miye khiwagiiya mkabonde ubosi mwe minda ambayo khamwekuiima, watuhu nee wakagosoa ndima uko, akini nywinywi mwapata myengizo kwembokea ndima yao.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Wasamalia wangi wa mzi uda wakamzumiiya Yesu kwaajii ya mbui ekugombekazo yuda mvyee kuwa, “Kanivuhuzia mbui zose nekuzigosoazo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Wasamalia wakambasa Yesu wakamuombeza ekae nawo, akekaa mwe mzi uwo misi miidi.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Wantu wangi wamzumiiya Yesu kwaajii ya mbui zakwe <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Wakamwamba yuda mvyee, “Khatizumiiya du kwaajii ya mbui zako, akini swie wenye timtegeeza na timmanya kuwa uyu nee kwei Mwohozi wa inusi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mwana wa mgookezi yumwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Yekwembokaho misi miidi, Yesu akahauka hada akaita mwe si ya Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Kwaviya Yesu mwenye kavuhuzia pwii, “Muoni khana atunywe mwe mzi wakwe mwenye.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ekubuaho mwe si ya Galilaya, wantu wa Wagalilaya wangi wakamhokea, kwaajii nao nee waita kwe sikukhuu ya Pasaka Yelusalemu, nako nee wawa wayaona yose ambayo Yesu kayagosoa.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu akabua vituhu mzi wa Kana uko Galilaya, hantu ekuhituaho mazi na kuwa divai. Nee kuwa na mgookezi yumwe ekuwae na mwana mtamu uko Kapelinaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Muongoezi uyo ekusikiaho Yesu kalawa Uyahudi na kubua Galilaya akambasa akamwoombeza aite akamhonye mwanawe mwekuwa mtamu wa kukauwiiwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu akamwamba, “Mkesekuona utangio na vihii khamna mzumiiye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Uyo Mwoongoezi akamwamba, “Zumbe chondechonde tite mwanangu asekweza kuuya na nyuma.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu akamwamba, “Hita mwanao ni mgima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Uyo muongoezi nee azumiiya mbui za Yesu, akaita zakwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ekuaho yu siai, akakintana na wandima wakwe wakamwamba, “Yuda Mwana kindee kahona.”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Naye akawauza neeiwa saa nyingahi mwana ekuhoneaho, wakamwamba, “Zana saa mfungate wa musi, utamu ukamuweekea”. <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Uyo tati yakwe akakumbuka iwa saa idaida Yesu ekumwambaho, “Mwanao ni mgima.” Aho akazumiiya hamwe na nyumba yakwe yose.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Unu nee utangio wa kaidi ekugosoao Yesu ekuaho akaawa Uyahudi kuita Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mtu uko Betisaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Yekwembokaho ayo, Yesu akaita Yelusalemu kwe sikukhuu ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Uko Yelusalemu, hehi na uvi wetangwao uvi wa ngoto, nehawa na tondoo da mazi detangwado kwa kiebulania Betisaza ambado nee dizunguukwa na mabaaza mashano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Aho nehawa na watamu wangi wekaa, matuntu, na wesao kudaha kwenda, na wekuhooawo. Newawa wakagoja mazi yatibulwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Kwaviya mndima wa uwanga wa Muungu kuna kisingi aseeya na kuyavuuga mazi mwe tindiziwa ido, mtamu yoyose avokae kwengia mwe mazi aho mazi yakatibulwa, ahona utamu wakwe wowose ekuwao nao. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Aho, hana mgosi mwekuwa mtamu kwa kisingi cha myaka makumi matatu na minane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu ekumuonaho kagona aho na kumanya kuwa kawa mtamu kwa misi mingi, akamwamba, “Ivi, wakunda kuhona?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Yuda mtamu akamtambaisa, “Zumbe khina mntu wa kunegaa mwe tondoo da mazi kisingi yakatibulwa, kia nikageeza kwengia mntu mtuhu aniongweeya.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu akamwamba “Gooka, na doa javi dako wende.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Vuupuu uyo mntu akahona, akadoa javi dakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Akavoka kwenda, mbui inu igosoka Msi wa Kuhumwiiza. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Wamwe wa waongoezi wa Wayahudi wakamwamba yuda mwe kuhonywa, “Ivyeeo ni Msi wa Kuhumwiiza kwa miko yetu khukundigwa wenue javi dako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Yee akawatambaisa, “Yuda mntu mwekunihonya nee mwekunamba udoe javi dako wende.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Nawo wakamuuza, “Uyo mntu mwekukwamba udoe javi dako wende ni ndai?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Iya yuda mntu khekummanya mntu mwekumhonya, Yesu nee kahauka kae hantu hada, kwaajii nee hana zumwezumwe kuu da wantu.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Naho bada ya ayo, Yesu akambwiiya yuda mntu mwekumhonya mwe Nyumba ya Muungu akamwamba, “Isasa kuhona, wesekugosoa mavigaviga vituhu, usekweza kubwiiwa ni mbui fyaimi muno.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Yuda mntu akaita, akawamba wakuu wa Kiyahudi, Yesu nee mwekunihonya. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kwaviya Yesu ida mbui kaigosoa Msi wa Kuhumwiiza, Wayahudi wakavoka kumkefyakefya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu akawamba, “Tate yangu agosoa ndima misi yose, na miye nagosoa ndima kwesiho kueka.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kwa mbui izi waongoezi wa Kiyahudi wakoondeza sia ya kumkoma Yesu, khio kwaviya kabananga miko ya Msi wa Kuhumwiiza du, akini kamba Muungu ni Tati yakwe ivyo ketenda aigana na Muungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udaho wa Mwana wa Muungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu akawamba, “Kwei nawamba, Mwana khadaha kugosoa kintu ikedu, adaha kugosoa kia amuonacho Tate agosoacho, kwaviya agosoacho Tate, Mwana nae akigosoa viyaviya.” <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Kwaviya Tate amkundisa Mwana, na kumuonyesha kia kintu agosoacho mwenye. Naho endaamuonyeshe mbui khuu kusima izi, nanywi mwendamhondomae. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Inga viya Tate ayuyusavyo wekuuyao na nyuma, na kuwekha ugima, ivyoivyo Mwana naye awekha ugima wada awakundisao. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Tate khamuamuiiya mntu yoyose, iya kamtenda mwana awaamwiiye wantu wose. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Ili wantu wamtegeeze Mwana inga wamtegeezavyo Tate, yoyose esaekumtegeeza Mwana khamtegeeza Tate wekumwaagiiaye Mwana.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Nawamba kwei, wada wategeezao mbui zangu na kumzumiia yuda mwekuniagiiya wana ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, khana aamuiiwe katu, kwaviya wavota kae ufe na kwengia mwe ugima misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi.” <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Nawamba kwei, kisingi cheza, naho kibuwa kae, na wada wekuwao hae na Muungu, wenda wategeeze mgutio wa Mwana wa Muungu, awo wenda wahokee ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Inga viya Tate awekhavyo wantu ugima, viyaviya kamtenda Mwana awekhe wantu ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Naho kamwekha Mwana udaho wa kuamuiiya, kwaviya ni Mwana wa Mntu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Msekuhondomaa kwaajii ya mbui inu, kisingi cheza ambacho wose wekuuyao na nyuma wenda wategeeze mgutio ambao wose wekuwao mwe mambiya. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Nawo wendawalawe mwe mambiya wada wekugosoao matana, wenda wayuyuke na kwekaa, wada wekugosoao yesayokutama wenda wayuyuswe na kuamuiiwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wavuhuzi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Yesu akaendeea kugombeka, “Khidaha kugosoa kintu kwa udaho wangu mwenye, miye neamuiiya inga nitegeezavyo kulawa kwa Tate na uwo wedi wangu ni wa kwei, kwaviya khigosoa nikundavyo mwenye, iya akundavyo yuda mwekuniagiiya.”<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Inga nawagombeka nywie mbui zangu mwenye, naho yada nigombekayo khamyavuhuzia kuwa ni ya kwei. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Akini hana mntu mtuhu avuhuziae mbui zangu kwenu, na namanya agombeka kwei. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Nywie nee muagiiya wantu kwa Yohana wamuuze mbui zangu, nae akawavuhuzia ni kwei. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Khio inga nakauwiiya wantu wanivuhuzie, akini nayagombeka aya ili mdahe kuoholwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana nee kawa inga taa yekuwayo ikaka na kulavya ung'azi, nanywi muwa na nyemi na ung'azi uwo kwa kisingi kijihi. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Akini kuna mbui khuu muno iyonyeshayo miye ni ndai kusima yada ekugombekayo Yohana mbatiiza. Mbui yenye ni zia ndima ekunekhazo Tate nizigosoe, ayo yose yanivuhuzia miye ni ndai na yaonyesha Tate nee mwekuniagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Naye tate mwekuniagiiya kanivuhuzia miye ni ndai, akini khamzati kutegeeza mgutio wakwe, naho kumwona yee eivyo, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />na mbui yakwe khayekwekaa mwe mioyo yenu, kwaviya khamwekumzumiiya yuda mwekumuagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Nywie mwayasunguumanya muno Maandiko ya Muungu kwaviya mwamamaakhanya mwe ayo mwendampate ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, na Maandiko ayo yanivuhuzia miye! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Ata ivyo khamkunda kweza kwangu ili mhokee ugima.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Miye khiondeza kutunywa na wantu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Akini nawamanya nywie ni wantu wa namna yani, na viyaviya khamna ukundiso wa Muungu mwe mioyo yenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Miye ncheza kwa udaho wa Tate, akini khamnihokea, akini akeza mntu mtuhu kwa udaho wakwe mwenye, mwenda mumhokee. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mwakunda kuhokea ntunyo kulawa kwenu nywie wenye, akini khamkunda kuhokea ntunyo kulawa kwa Muungu mwenye, kwaajii iyo mwadaha viivihi kunizumiiya? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Akini wesekufanyanya kuwa miye nenendae niwaahie masa kwa Tate, Musa ambae mwamkauwiya neendae awaahie masa. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ati kwei nee mkamzumiiya Musa, nee mkanizumiiya na miye, kwaviya Musa kaandika mbui zangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Akini kwaviya khamyazumiiya yada ekuyaandikayo Musa, mwadaha viivihi kuzumiia kiya nigombekacho?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awekha khande wantu elufu shano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Yekwembokaho ayo, Yesu akadumua tindiziwa da mazi da Galilaya. Kwa zina tuhu detangwa ziwa da Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Zumwezumwe kuu da wantu dikatendesa kumbasa kwaajii waona ntangio nyingi na vihii ekugosoazo kwa watamu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu akakwea kwe muima, akekaa hamwe na wahina wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Na Sikukhuu ya Wayahudi yetangwayo Pasaka iwa hehi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Naho Yesu ekukauwaho, na kuona zumwezumwe da wantu dikeza kwakwe, akamwamba Fiipo, “Tendatigue hahi mabumunda, wantu awa wadahe kuda?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Nee kauza mbui iyo kumgeeza Fiipo kwaviya kamanya endachoagosoe.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Fiipo akamtambaisa, “Ata inga tikawa na hea dinali mia mbii nee khatokudaha kugua mabumunda ya kuwekha wantu awa.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mhina yakwe yumwe mwetangwa Andulea uyo nee kawa nduguye Simoni Petulo akamwamba Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Yuhanu mbwanga yumwe ana mabumunda mashano ya shaili na samaki vidodo viidi, akini vyendavitoshe mbwai kwa wantu wangi inga awa?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu akamba, “Waikeni wantu,” hantu hada nehawa na ulondo mtana, wantu wakekaa, na wagosi du nee wawa elufu shano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Naho Yesu akadoa yada mabumunda akamtogoa Muungu, akawapangia wantu wekuawo wekaa, akagosoa viyaviya na wada samaki, kia mntu akahokea na akada inga akundavyo kuda. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Wantu wekwegutaho Yesu akawamba wahina wakwe, “Dodoani phuguntio zekusigaazo kisekwaga chochose.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Wakadodoa phuguntio zia za mabumunda ya shaili vyekusigazwavyo na wada wantu wekudao, wakamemeeza ngahu kumi dimwe na mbii.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Wantu wekuonaho ntangio icho ekugosoacho Yesu wakamba, “Kwei uyu nee muoni tekumkauwiaye endaeze mwe inusi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu akamanya kuwa wantu waondeza kumdoa wamtende Seuta, akahauka vituhu akaita kwe muima yee ikedu.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu enda uwanga ya mazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Yekubuaho guoni wahina wakwe Yesu wakaseeya mwe mazimshindo, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />wakakwea ngaawa ili wemboke waite Kapelinaumu. Kiza nee chengia kae, na Yesu nee khazati kuseeya mwe muima ili awe nawo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Tindiziwa da mazi dikavoka kuvuugika kwaajii khusi khai neiwa yavuma. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Wahina wakwe Yesu newawa wakatoa makasia kuita inga uhae wa kilomita shano hambu mtandatu, wakamwona Yesu akenda uwanga ya mazi, akaitimia ngaawa wakaogoha muno. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Akini Yesu akawamba, “Ni miye msekuogoha.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Nee wakoondeza kumwegaa Yesu he mpwani ahoaho ngaawa ibuwa mwe si khavu wekuwayo waita.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wamuondeza Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Kioi dakwe zumwezumwe da wantu wada wekuwao wekaa phande ya kaidi ya tindiziwa da mazi nee wakabukhua kuwa hawa na ngaawa mwengadu hantu hada, Yesu khekwengia mwe ida ngaawa hamwe na wahina wakwe, iya wahina awo nee waita kae ikedu. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Wantu watuhu kulawa Tibelia wakabuwa na ngaawa, hantu hada wantu wekudaho mabumunda, Zumbe ekumtogoaho Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Naho wantu wekumanyaho ati Yesu na wahina wakwe khawekuwaaho hantu hada, wakakwea mwe ngaawa izo na wakaita Kapelinaumu kumuondeza Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nee bumunda da ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Wada wantu wekumbwiiaho Yesu phande ya kaidi ya tondoo da mazi wakamuuza, “Mhinyi, kubuwa ini aha?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Nawamba kwei mwaniondeza khio kwa viya muona ntangio nekugosoavyo, iya kwaajii nee mda yada mabumunda mkeguta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Msekugosoa ndima kwaajii ya kwepata khande ibanikayo, iya gosoani ndima kwaajii ya khande yesayo kubanika vyekaa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. Khande izo zendaziwekhe ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi kulawa kwa Muungu. Mwana wa Mntu nee endayeawekhe khande iyo, kwaajii Tate Muungu khamwekha udaho wa kugosoa ivyo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Wowo wakauza, “Titende mbwai tidahe kugosoa ndima za Muungu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu akawatambaisa, akawamba, “Ndima ambayo Muungu akunda mwiigosoe nikunizumiiya mie, ambae kiagiiwa nae.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Aho wakamwamba, “Wendaugosoe ntangio yani ili tiikauwe tidahe kukuzumiiya? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Mababa zetu wada khande yekwetangwayo mana kuda kwe kiwawe, inga yagombekavyo Maandiko ya Muungu, ‘Kawaisa mabumunda kulawa uwanga.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu akagombeka, “Nawamba kwei, Musa khekuwekha mabumunda kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu, iya Tate yangu nee awekhae nywie bumunda da kwei, kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kwaviya bumunda da Muungu ni yuda ekuseeaye kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu, ili awekhae wantu wa inusi inu ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Aho wakamwamba, “Zumbe, kuvoka isasa tekhe bumunda ido misi yose.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu akawamba, “Miye nee bumunda da ugima.” Na mntu yoyose ezae kwangu na kunizumiiya khanaawe na saa wala khiu katu. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Akini nawamba kuwa, mniona akini khamnizumiiya. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Wose anekhao Tate, wendaweze hangu na mie katu khina nimwase chongoi yoyose mwendaeeze hangu, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kwaviya khiseeya kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu, khio kwaajii ya kugosoa yada niyakundayo mie, iya kugenyeza yada akundayo Muungu mwekuniagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Na yada akundayo Muungu mwekuniagiiya nee aya, nesekumwaza ata yumwe gatigati ya wada ekunekhao, iya niwayuyuse wose msi wa kisikizi. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kwaviya akundavyo Tate, nee iki kia mntu amkauwaye Mwana na kumzumiiya, awe na ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, naho nenda nimyuyuse msi wa kisiikizi.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Aho Wayahudi wakavoka kung'ung'uzika kwaviya kagombeka, “Miye ni bumunda dekuseeyado kulawa uwanga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Wakamba, “Uyu khi Yesu mwana wa Yusufu? Tammanya tati yakwe na mami yakwe naho, adaha vivihi kugombeka ati kaseeya kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Ekani kunung'unika nywinywi kwa nywie. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Khahana mntu adahae kweza kwangu, inga Tate mwekuniagiiya khekumuongoea kwangu, na miye nendanimyuyuse mntu uyo msi wa kisiikizi. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Muoni yumwe wa Muungu nee kaandika mwe kitabu cha Muungu, ‘Wantu wose wenda wahinywe ni Muungu.’ Kia mntu amtegeezaye na kumzumiia Tate, eza kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Inu khaina mana kuwa, yuuko mntu yee ikedu mwekumuona Tate, iya ni yuda ekulawae kwa Muungu, uyo nee mwekumuona Tate. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Kwei nawamba, mnizumiiya ana ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Miye ni bumunda da ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Mababa zenu nee wada khande yekwetangwayo mana kuda kwe kiwawe, akini wauya na nyuma. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Akini idi ni bumunda diseeyado kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu, mntu yoyose adae khadaha kuuya na nyuma. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Miye ni bumunda da ugima wekuseeao kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu, mntu yoyose mwendaye ade bumunda idi endaekae misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, na bumunda nendado nimwekhe ni mwii wangu naulavya kwa ugima wa inusi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Aho Wayahudi wakavoka kuhigana wowo wenye wakauzana, “Adaha viivihi kutekha mwii wakwe tiude?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu akawamba, “Nawamba ukwei, mkesekuuda mwii wa Mwana wa Mntu na kudomea phome yakwe khamnamuwe na ugima mwe mii yenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Adae mwii wangu na kudomea phome yangu anawo ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, na miye nenda nimyuyuse msi wa kisiikizi. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwaviya mwii wangu ni khande ya kwei na phome yangu ni kidomewacho cha kwei. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Yoyose adae mwii wangu na kudomea phome yangu ekaa umu mwangu na miye nekaa kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Tate wa ugima kaniagiiya nigosoe ndima na miye nekaa kwaajii yakwe, ivyo anidae miye naye endaekae kwaajii yangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Naho idi nee bumunda dekuseeyado kulawa uwanga, khio inga bumunda wekudayo mababa zenu, ata ivyo wakauya na nyuma, adae bumunda idi endaawe na ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu kagombeka ayo ekuaho akahinya he Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi uko Kapelinaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbui zietazo ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ivyo, wahina wakwe wekutegeezaho mbui inu wakamba, “Mahinyo aya khayava ni ndai adahae kuyahokea?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu akamanya kwesiho kugombekwa ni mntu kuwa wahina wakwe nee wang'ung'uzika kwa mbui iyo akawauza, “Ivi mbui inu yawatenda muwe na maatu? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Yendaiwe viivihi mwendaho mmuone Mwana wa Mntu akakwea na kuita uwanga kwa Muungu kuda ekulawako? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Muye wa Muungu nee uetao ugima, mwii khauna udaho wakugosoa kintu. Mbui nekuwagombekazo zalawa kwa Muye wa Muungu na yaeta ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Akini, wantu watuhu gatigati yenu khawazumiiya.” Yesu kagombeka ivyo kwaviya kamanya kuvokea aho bosi, wada ambao khawana wamzumiye gatigati yao na yuda ambae enda amhituke. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Akatendesa kugombeka, “Kwaajii inu, nee nekuwambavyo kuwa khahana mntu adahae kweza hangu kwesiho kuongoewa na Tate yangu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kwaajii ya ayo, wahina wakwe wangi wekumtongeao Yesu, wakauya mgeeka, wasekutongeana nae vituhu. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Ivyo Yesu akawauza wada kumi dimwe na mbii, “Nanywi mwakunda kuhauka?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petulo akamtambaisa, “Zumbe tendatiite kwa ndai? Wee una mbui za ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Swie tazumiiya na kumanya kuwa wee nee Klistu mwekusagulwae kulawa kwa Muungu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu akawauza, “Ivi ncheekuwasagua nywie kumi dimwe na mbii? Na yumwe aongoewa na Ibiisi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu kagombeka ayo kwaajii ya Yuda, mwana wa Simoni Isikaliote kwaviya uyu nee endaeamhituke, etiho ni yumwe da wada kumi dimwe na mbii.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na wanduguze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Yekwembokaho ayo, Yesu nee avoka kuzunguka kia hantu mwe mizi ya Galilaya, khekukunda kuita si ya Yudea kwaajii waongweezi wa Kiyahudi nee wakaondeza kumkoma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Kisingi cha sikukhuu mwenga ya Wayahudi yetangwayo sikukhuu ya vikumbi nee iwa hehi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Naho nduguze da Yesu wakamwamba, “Hauke aho uite si ya Yudea ili wahina wako wakaone ndima uzigosoazo. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Mntu khagosoa mbui kwa sii inga akakunda kumanyika kwa wantu, kwaviya wagosoa mbui izi, naho eambaze mwe inusi wantu ili wakumanye.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Naho ata wanduguze wagombeka ivyo kwaviya khawekumzumiiya.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu akawamba, “Kisingi changu cha kuita uko Yelusalemu khakizati kubuwa, akini nywie mwadaha kuita kisingi chochose. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Wantu wa mwe inusi inu khawamiemea nywie, akini miye waniemea kwaajii nawavuhuzia kuwa wagosoa mafyaimi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Nywie hitani kwe sikukhuu iyo, miye khina niite kwe sikukhuu iyo, kwaviya mda wangu ukundigwao khauzati kubuwa.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Yesu ekubindiizaho kugombeka ivyo, akasigaa uko Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kwe sikukhuu ya makumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Wanduguze nee waongowa kuita kwe sikukhuu Yelusalemu, Yesu naye akaita, akini kwa sii. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Naho Waongoeezi wa Kiyahudi kisingi waaho mwe sikukhuu na kuwauza wantu, “Yu hahi mtu uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Hawa na mipokoso mingi mwe zumwezumwe da wantu, wamwe wakamba, “Ni mntu yedi.” Watuhu wakamba, “Khivyo kwaviya awaza wantu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Na ivyo khahana mntu mwekugeeza kugombeka mbui zakwe hewazo kwa kuogoha waongoezi wa Kiyahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Sikukhuu iyo yekubuaho gatigati, Yesu nee aita he Nyumba ya Muungu, akavoka kuhinya. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Naho Wayahudi wakahondomaa na kugombeka, “Mntu uyu kamanya viivihi mbui izi kwesiho kuhinywa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Mahinyo nihinyayo khio yangu, iya yalawa kwa Muungu mwekuniagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mntu mkunda kugosoa yada akundayo Muungu, endaamanye mahinyo yangu yalawa kwa Muungu, hambu negombekea ni yamie mwenye. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Yee egombekeaye mwenye aondeza Ukuu mwenye, akini aondezae ukuu kwa yuda mwekuniagiiya, uyo agombeka yekuwayo kwei na khagombeka uhokho. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Ivi Musa khekuwekha miagiiyo ambayo kekhigwa ni Muungu? Na ivyo khahana katu mntu yumwe mtoza miko kwa mbwai mwaonda kunikoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Aho wantu wakamtambaisa, “Wee una zaiko, nindai muondeza kukukoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Kuna mbui mwenga nekugosoayo nanywi yawahondomaza. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa nee kawaagiiya nywie kugwisa wana wenu wakigosi. Kugombeka kwei mbui iyo ivoka kwa mababa zenu, akini nywie mwawagwisa wana wenu ata Msi wa Kuhumwiiza. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Ikawa mntu adaha kugwiswa ata Msi wa Kuhumwiiza ili kuitoza miagiiyo ya Musa, kwambwai mwanikima kwaviya khihonya mntu Msi wa Kuhumwiiza? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mwesekumuamuiya mntu kwa mbui zionekazo kwa chongoi, iya mumuamuiiye mntu kwa wedi na ikundigwavyo.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nee Klistu Mwohozi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Wamwe wa wantu wa Yelusalemu nee wagombeka, “Ivi, uyu khio yuda mntu ambae waongweezi wakunda kumkoma? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mbona yuaha atamwiiya hemeso ya wantu, naho khahana mntu agombekae mbui yoyose! Ivi yadahika waongoeezi wamanya kwei inga uyu nee Klistu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Endahoeze Klistu Mwohozi, khahana mntu endayeamanye hantu ekulawiako, akini swie tamanya alawiako.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Aho Yesu ekuwaho akahinya he Nyumba ya Muungu, akagombeka kwa mgutio mkuu, “Inga mwanimanya, uko nilawiako mwakumanya na ivyo ncheekweza kwa udaho wangu iya ni yuda mwekuniagiiya miye ni wa kwei, nywie khamummanya, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />akini miye nammanya kwaviya kilawiya kwakwe na yee nee mwekuniagiiya.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Naho, wantu nee wakaondeza kumgwiya akini khahana mwekudaha kumgwiya kwaviya mda wakwe nee khauzati kubua. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Wantu wangi mwe dia zumwezumwe da wantu nee wamzumiiya na kugombeka, “Ivi, Klistu akeza endaagosoe ntangio vikuu kusima ekugosoazo uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagoji waagiiwa kumgwiya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayo wawategeeza wantu wakapokosa mbui izo za Yesu, aho wowo hamwe na waviki wakuu wakawaagiiya wagoji wamgwiye. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu akamba, “Nikeaho na nywie kwa kisingi kijihi, nikabinda nendaniuye kwa yuda mwekuniagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Mwenda mniondeze akini khamna mnione na hada nendahoniwe, nywie kwamdaha kubua.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Waongoeezi wa Kiyahudi wakauzana wowo kwa wowo, “Mntu uyu enda aite kuhi ambaho khatina tidahe kumuona? Endaaite kwa Wayahudi wekuambazikao gatigati ya Wagiiki na kuwahinya Wagiiki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ivi akunda kugombeka mbwai agombekaho, mwenda mniondeze akini khamna mnione na hada nendaho niwe nywie khamdaha kubua.”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vizigizigi vya mazi vietavyo ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Msi wa kisiikizi wa sikukhuu iyo nee ni msi maalum, Yesu akagooka, akagombeka kwa mgutio mkuu, “Mtozwa ni khiu na eze kwangu adomee mazi, <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />inga yagombekavyo Maandiko ya Muungu, ‘Mnizumiiya miye, vizigizigi vya mazi ya ugima vyenda vimwamwaike kulawa mwe moyo wakwe.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Kagombeka ayo kuusu Muye kwa wada wamzumiiao yee wendawamhokee, kisingi icho Muye khazati kweza, kwa ivyo Yesu nee khazati atogolwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwepanga gati ya wantu mwe mbui ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Wantu watuhu he dia zumwezumwe wategeeza mbui izo, “Kwei mntu uyu Muoni.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Watuhu wamba, “Uyu nee Klistu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Akini watuhu wamba, “Yadahika viivihi Klistu akalawiiya mwe si ya Galilaya! <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Maandiko ya Muungu yamba kuwa, Klistu endaalawiiye he muango wa Seuta Daudi, na endaavyaigwe Betilehemu mzi ekuwao akekaa Daudi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Nee kwalawiiya kwepanga kwaajii yakwe he dia zumwezumwe da wantu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Wantu watuhu nee wakoondeza kumgwiya Yesu, akini khahana mntu mwekugeeza kumgwiya.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waongoezi wa Wayahudi khawazumiiya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Naho wada wagoji wakauya kwa waviki wakuu na Mafalisayo na wakauzwa, “Kwa mbwai khamwekumweeta Yesu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Wagoji wakawatambaisa, “Khahana mntu ekulawiyae na kugombeka mbui khuu inga mntu uyu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafalisayo wakawauza, “Ivi nywie nanywi mtiiwa?” <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />“Ivi, mwammanya mwoongoezi yoyose, hambu yumwe wa Mafalisayo mwekumzumiiya mntu uyu? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Akini zumwezumwe da wantu wamzumiiao, khawamanya miagiiyo ya Musa, kubadiwa lazi na Muungu.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Yumwe yao kawa Nikodemo uyo nee mwekumbasa Yesu na kio, naho nee mwekugombeka. <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Miagiiyo tekwekhigwayo na Muungu kwembokea Musa yatiemeza kumuamuiiya mntu kabla ya kumtegeeza na kumanya kia ekugosoacho.”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Nawo wakamtambaisa, “Wee nawe kulawa si ya Galilaya? Ni vyedi, kayasunguumanye Maandiko ya Muungu nawe wendauone kuwa Galilaya khakulawa katu muoni.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Naho wose wakahauka, kiya mntu akaita kwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mvyee mwekutozwa ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Akini Yesu akaita he muima wa Mizaituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Kioi dakwe keokeo, Yesu nee aita vituhu kwe Nyumba ya Muungu, wantu wose wakambasa, nae akekaa akahinya. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Naho Wahinya wa miagiiyo na Mafalisayo wakamweeteya mvyee yumwe mwekutozwa heugoni, wakamgoosa gatigati yawo. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Nee wamuuza, “Mhinyi!” “Mvyee uyu timbwiiya he ugoni. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mwe miagiiyo yetu Musa katiagiiya mvyee inga uyu atoigwe maiwe adi auye na nyuma, tambe nawe wambaze?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Wowo wagombeka ivyo, ili wapate mbui yendayoiwatende wamuahiye masa. Akini Yesu akenama na kuaandika asi kwa chaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Wekutendesaho kumuuza, Yesu akenuka akawamba, “Yumwe yenu mwesekuwa na mavigaviga na avoke kumtambikia iwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Naho akenama vituhu, na kuandika ahosi kwa chaa chakwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Wekutegeezaho ayo, wakavoka kuhauka yumweyumwe, wakaongoa wadaa, Yesu akasigaa ikedu kidege na yuda mvyee kagooka hadahada. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu ekwenukaho akamuuza yuda mvyee, “Wahahi wada wantu? Ivi khahana katu ata yumwe mwekukuamuiiya?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Uyo mvyee akamtambaisa, “Zumbe khahana ata yumwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Na Yesu akamwamba, “Miye nami khinanikuamuiiye, hita na usekugosoa mavigaviga vituhu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni ung'azi wa inusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu akatamwiiya nao vituhu, akawamba, “Mie nee ung'azi wa inusi, yoyose anibasae endaawe na ung'azi umuongoeae mwe ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, naho khanaende mwe kiza katu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Mafalisayo wakamwamba kwei Yesu, “Mbui zako wegombekea mwenye, ivyo khahana mntu akuvuhuziae mbui zako.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Ata inga nevuhuzia mwenye, yada nigombekayo ni ya kwei, kwaviya namanya nilawako na niitako, akini nywie khammanya nilawako wala niitako. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Nywinywi mwaamuiiya wantu kwakuwakauwa viya wagosoavyo, akini mie khiamuiiya mntu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Etiho nikaamuiiya, uwamuiiyo wangu ni kwei, kwa ivyo miye khio ikedu, Tate mwekuniagiiya yu hamwe na miye. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Iyandikwa mwe miagiiyo yenu, kuwa uvuhuzi wa wantu waidi, mbui iyo ni kwei. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Miye nevuhuzia mwenye na Tate mwekuniagiiya nae anivuhuzia.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Aho wakamuuza Yesu, “Tati yako yu hahi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu akawatambaisa, “Nywie khamnimanya miye naho khamummanya Tate, ati nee mkanimanya nee mkammanya na Tate.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu kagombeka mbui izo mwe chumba cha kiikizo, ekuwaho akahinya kwe Nyumba ya Muungu, naho khahana mntu mwekumgwiya, kwaviya mda wakwe khauzati kubua.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awagombeka wantu mbui ya ufe wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu akawamba vituhu, “Miye naita na nywie mwenda mniondeze, akini mwenda muuye na nyuma kwa mavigaviga yenu, niitako miye, nywie khamdaha kweza.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Waongoeezi wa Kiyahudi wakauzana, “Ivi endaekome mwenye? Kwambwai amba, niitako khamna mbue.”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu akawamba, “Nywie mlawa ahaaha asi, miye nalawa uwanga kwa Muungu, nywie ni wa mwe inusi inu, miye khio wa mwe inusi inu. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Nee mana nikawamba, ‘mwenda muuye na nyuma he mavigaviga yenu mkesekuzumiiya kuwa miye nee mweaho ambae niaho mwenda muuye na nyuma kwa mavigaviga yenu.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Wowo wakamuuza Yesu, “Wee ni ndai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu akawatambaisa, “Miye nee yuda nekuwagombekae aho bosi. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ninayo mangi ya kugombeka na kuwamuiiya uwanga yenu, akini yuda mwekuniagiiya ni kwei nami nawamba wantu wainusi mbui ziyadu nekuzitegeezazo kulawa kwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Khawekuva ati Yesu kagombeka nawo kuusu Tati yakwe wa uwanga kwa Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yesu akawamba, “Mwendaho mmwenue Mwana wa Mntu aho ndiho mwendaho mmanye, ‘Mie nee uyo’ na kuwa khigosoa chochose mie kwa udaho wangu akini nagombekadu yada Tate ekunihinyayo. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Yuda mwekuniagiiya yuhamwe namiye, yee khekunibada ikedu kwaviya nagosoa yada yamtamiayo misi yose.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Ekubindaho kugombeka ayo wantu wangi wakamzumiia.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahina wa kwei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu akawamba wada Wayahudi wamzumiiao, “Ati mkayatozeeza mahinyo yangu, mwendamuwe wahina wangu kwei. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Naho Mwenda mmanye kwei, kwasia ya ukwei uwo Muungu eza kuwaekea kulawa mwe utumwa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Wowo wakamuuza, “Swie tiuvyazi wa Ibulahimu na khatizati katu kuwa watumwa wa mntu yawa viivihi ukamba tenda tiekewe?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Nawamba kwei kia mntu mgosoa mavigaviga ni mtumwa wa mavigaviga. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mtumwa khana chekao cha kwekaa mwe nyumba, akini Mwana anacho chekao kisingi chose. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Inga Mwana akawaekea kulawa mwe utumwa wa mavigaviga, mwenda muwe muekewa kweikwei. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Namanya nywie ni muango wa Ibulahimu, na ivyo mwaondeza kunikoma kwaviya muyaemea mahinyo yangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Miye nagombeka ekunionyeshayo Tate, akini nywie mwagosoa yada yekugombekwayo na Tati yenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Wowo wakamtambaisa, “Swie tiwana wa Ibulahimu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu akawamba, “Inga nywie ni wana wa Abulahamu, nee mkagosoa inga yada ekugosoayo Abulahamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Nawamba ukwei, nekuutegeezao kwa Muungu, na ivyo nywie mwaondeza kunikoma, Ibulahimu khekugosoa ivyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Nywie mwagosoa mbui ziyaziya ekugosoazo tati yenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Wowo wakamwamba, “Swie khio wanahalamu na tinae Tate yumwedu na nee Muungu yetu!”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu akawamba, “Inga Muungu nee tati yenu nee mkanikundisa, kwaviya miye nalawa kwa Muungu isasa niaha, ncheekweza kwa udaho wangu mwenye, iya yee Muungu mwekuniagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Kwa mbwai khamva ayo nigombekayo? Kwaviya muemea kutegeeza mbui yangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Nywie ni wana wa tati yenu Ibiisi mwaondeza kugosoa mbui akundazo tati yenu. Yee kawa mkomaji kuvokea aho bosi, wala khekugooka mwe ukwei, kwaviya kwei khaimo umo mwakwe. Kia agombekaho uhokho, agombeka uhokho kwaajii nee eivyo, kwaviya yee ni mhokho na tate wa uwo uhokho. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Akini mie nagombeka ukwei, nee kiekacho nywie msekunizumiiya. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Yuhi gatigati yenu adahae kumanya ati mie nina mavigaviga? Ati nagombeka ukwei kwa mbwai khamnizumiiya? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Mntu wa Muungu ategeeza mbui za Muungu akini nywie khamtegeeza, ivyo nywie khio wantu wa Muungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Wayahudi wakamtambaisa Yesu, “Uwo khatekugombeka ukwei ati wee umsamalia naho una zaiko?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Mie khina mazaiko, mie namtegeeza Tate, iya nywie khamnitegeeza mie. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Miye khiondeza wantu wanitunye akini yuaho akundae wantu wanitunye na yee nee mwaamua inga nagosoa ikundigwavyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Kwei nawamba, mwekutozeeza mbui zangu khana auye na nyuma kisingi chose.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Aho Wayahudi wakamba, “Isasa tamanya kwei kuwa wee una zaiko! Ibulahimu kauya na nyuma, Waoni nawo wauya na nyuma, wee wamba mtozeeza mbui zangu khana auye na nyuma kisingi chose. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ivi wetenda umkuu kusima tati yetu Ibulahimu mwe kuuya na nyuma? Na waoni nawo wauya na nyuma, asa wee wetenda kuwa undai?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Inga nikefena mwenye, kwetogoa kwangu ni bue. Akini tate yangu uyo mgombekaye nee Muungu yenu, nee anitogoae. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Nywie khamzati kummanya akini mie nammanya, nikamba khimmanya nendaniwe mhokho inga nywinywi, mie nammanya na natoza mbui yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Baba yenu Ibulahimu kawa na nyemi muno kumanya kuwa miye nendaneze. Neekawa inga kaniona, nee kawa na nyemi muno.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Aho Wayahudi wakamwamba, “Wee khuzati kubuza myaka makumi mashano nawe kumwona kuhi Ibulahimu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu akawamba, “Kwei nawamba kisingi Ibulahimu khazati kuvyaigwa, ‘Mie nee Niuko.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Aho wakadoa maiwe ili wamtambikie, akini Yesu akefisa akalawa kwe Nyumba ya Muungu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mntu mwekuvyaigwa tuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu ekuaho akemboka, akamuona mntu yumwe mwekuvyaigwa tuntu. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Aho, wahina wakwe wakamuuza, “Mhinya! Ni yuhi mwekugosoa mavigaviga, mntu uyu hambu wavyazi wakwe ata avyaigwe tuntu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Mbui inu khayokulawiiya kwaajii ya mavigaviga yakwe wala mavigaviga ya wavyazi wakwe, iya kavyaigwa tuntu ili udaho wa Muungu uoneke ukagosoa ndima umo mwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Kukawa kuke musi takundigwa titendese kugosoa ndima za yuda mwekuniagiiya, mana kio cheza mntu khadaha kugosoa ndima. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Kisingi nike mwe inusi, mie ni ung'azi wa inusi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ekubindaho kugombeka ayo, akaswa ovu ahosi, akagosoa ntope kwa dia ovu, akamsisa yuda tuntu he meso. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Akamwamba, “Hita ukesunte cheni he tondoo da mazi da siloamu” mana ya zina idi ni mwekuagiiwa, aho yuda tuntu akaita, akesunta akauya uku aona.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Naho wahehi yakwe, na wada wekuwao wakammanya aho bosi kawa mkiwa mwekuwa akaombeza, wakamba, “Ivi, uyu khie yuda mkiwa mwekuwa akekaa na kuombeza?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Wamwe wao wakamba, “Ndie.” Watuhu wakamba, “Khio iya waigana nae.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Akini yuda ekuae khaona akamba “Ni miye.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Nae wakamuuza “Isasa meso yako yadaha vivihi kugubuka?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Naye akawatambaisa, “Yuda mntu etangwae Yesu, kagosoa ntope akanisisa mwe meso na kunamba, hita ukesunte he tondoo da siloamu, aho nee naita nikesunta nikadaha kuona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Wakamuuza, “Yee yu hahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Akawatambaisa, “Mie khimanya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafarisayo wamuuza yuda ekuwae tuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Nee wamwegaa yuda mntu mwekuwae tuntu kwa mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Msi uwo Yesu ekugosoaho ntope na kumgubua meso mntu uyo iwa Msi wa Kuhumwiiza. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Naho mafalisayo wakamuuza mntu uyo, “Kudaha viivihi kuona? Akawamba kanisisa ntope mwe meso, nami nikesunta, na isasa naona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Wamwe wa Mafalisayo wakamba, “Mntu uyu khee kulawa kwa Muungu mana khatoza miagiiyo ya Msi wa Kuhumwiiza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Akini watuhu wakamba, “Mntu mwenye mavigaviga adaha kugosoa viivihi utangio inga unu?” Ivyo Mafalisayo khawekwevana wowo wenye.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Wakamuuza vituhu yuda mwekuwa tuntu, “Kwa kuwa kakugubua meso wambaze uwanga ya mntu uyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Nae akawamba, “Yee ni Muoni wa Muungu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Waongoezi wa Kiyahudi khawekumzumiiya ati mntu uyo nee kawa tuntu aho bosi, na isasa aona, adi wekuwetangaho wavyazi wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Aho, wakawauza, awo wavyazi, “Uyu ni yuda mwana yenu mwekugombekae kavyaigwa tuntu? Kadaha viivihi kuona?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Wavyazi wakwe wakatambaisa, “Tamanya uyu ni mwana yetu na kavyaigwa tuntu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Akini kadaha viivihi kuona, khatimanya, nahodu khatimmanya yuda mwekumgubwiiya meso, muuzeni yee mwenye ni mntu mgima adaha kugombeka yee mwenye.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Wavyazi wakwe wamba ivyo kwa kuwaogoha waongoeezi wa Kiyahudi, kwa kuwa waongoeezi awo wevana kae, kuwa mntu yoyose agombeke Yesu nee Klistu, endaaguuswe he Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Nee mana wavyazi wakwe wakamba, “Yee ni mntu mgima muuzeni.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Naho wakamwetanga vituhu yuda mwekuwa tuntu, wakamwamba, “Gombeka ukwei mwekhe Muungu Ukuu swie tamanya ati mntu uyu ni mwenye mavigaviga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Yee akatambaisa, “Ati ni mwenye mavigaviga miye khimanya, akini kintu kimwe nakimanya, cheekuwa nikaona, na isasa naona!”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Aho wakamuuza, “Kakugosweea mbwai? Ayo meso yako kayagubua viivihi?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Uyo mntu akawatambaisa, “Khiwamba kae na nywie khamwekunitegeeza, kwa mbwai mwakunda kutegeeza vituhu? Ivi, mwakunda na nywie mtende wahina wakwe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Akini wowo waongoezi wa Wayahudi wakamdumua, wakamba, “Wee nawe ni mhina wakwe, akini swie ni wahina wa Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Swie tamanya kuwa Muungu kagombeka na Musa, akini mntu uyu khatimmanya kalawiiya kuhi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Naye akatambaisa, “Inu ni mbui ya kuhondomaza! Nywie khammanya kalawiiya kuhi, akini kanigubua meso yangu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tamanya kuwa Muungu khawategeeza wantu wenye mavigaviga, iya amtegeeza yoyose, mwenye hofu ya kumwogoha Muungu na kugosoa viya akundayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kuvokea aho bosi wa inusi, khatizati kutegeeza kuwa mntu kamhonya yoyose ekuwae tuntu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Inga mntu uyu kheekulawa kwa Muungu kheekuwa adahe kugosoa chochose.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Wowo wakamtambaisa, “Wee kuvyaigwa na kweewa he mavigaviga wadaha viivihi kutihinya swie?” Aho wakamguusa he Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waongoezi wa Wayahudi khawammanya Klistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu ekusikiaho kuwa wamguusa mntu uyo he Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi, akaita kumuondeza. Kisingi ekumbwiiaho akamuuza, akamba “Ivi wee wamzumiiya Mwana wa Mntu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Uyo mntu akamtambaisa, “Mkuu nambiya ni ndai, nidahe kumzumiiya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu akamwamba, “Kumwona kae na nee agombekae nawe isasa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Aho uyo mntu akamba, “Zumbe, Nazumiiya” akamkintia mavindi na kumvikia.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu akamba, “Miye ncheza mwe inusi kwaajii ya kuwekha sugusa wantu, ili wantu wada wesaokuona wadahe kuona na wamamaakhanyao waona, wesekudaha kuona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Wamwe wa Mafalisayo wekuwao hamwe nae, nee wasikia mbui izo wakamuuza, “Tambe swie ni matuntu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Ati nee nimatuntu, neekhamwekuwa na mavigaviga, akini isasa nywie mwamba, ‘Swie taona,’ na iyo yaonyesha ati mke na masa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Msimo wa muisi yedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu akawamba, “Nawamba ukwei, yoyose yuda mwesaekwengia mwe dewa da ngoto kwa kwembokea he uvi, iya ahenya na kwengia sia ntuhu, uyo ni mbavi na mhokaji. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Akini mwengia kwa kwembokea he uvi wa dewa, uyo nee muisi wa ngoto. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mgoji wa dewa amvugwiiya, na ngoto ava mgutio wakwe, na awetanga ngoto zakwe kia yumwe kwa zina dakwe, na kuwalavya chongoi. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Akabinda kuwalavya chongoi, aziongweeya na awo ngoto wamtongea, kwaviya waumanya mgutio wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ngoto izo khazidaha kutongea muisi mgeni, iya wendawamguuke kwaviya khawamanya mgutio wakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu akawamba msimo uwo akini wowo khawekumanya ekukundavyo kuwamba.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu muisi yedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yesu akagombeka vituhu, “Kwei nawamba, miye ni uvi wa ngoto. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Wada watuhu wose wekuniongweeao miye ni wabavi na wahokaji, akini ngoto khawekuwategeeza. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Miye ni inga uvi, mntu yoyose mwengia kwembokea kwangu endaaoholwe, endaengiye na kulawa chongoi na endaapate kia akundacho. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mbavi eza kwa kuondeza kubawa na kukoma, na kubananga. Miye ncheza ili muwe na ugima, naho wawe nao mwingi.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Miye ni muisi yedi. Muisi yedi ni yuda azumiiyae kuulavya ugima wakwe kwaajii ya ngoto zakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mntu agosoae ndima ya kibauwa cha kuisa ngoto ili ekhigwe hea naho ngoto khio mai yakwe, aonaho kui da mzituni dikeza, abada ngoto na kuguuka, naho kui da mzituni dawagwiya na kuwamwaganisa. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Yee khapatiiza kintu kuusu ngoto, kwaviya yee ni mkibauwa apatiiza kuihwa hea. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Miye ni muisi yedi wada wakwangu nawamanya, na wakwangu wanimanya. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Inga Tate animanyavyo, ivyoivyo na miye nammanya Tate, miye nazumiiya ata kuulavya ugima wangu ili ngoto wasekwaga. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Naho ninao ngoto watuhu, awo khawamo mwe dewa dangu, awo nakundigwa kuwaeta, naho wenda wategeeze mgutio wangu, kwenda kuwe na tintimo dimwe na muisi yumwe.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Tate anikundisa kwaviya miye mwenye naulavya ugima wangu, ili nidahe kuwa na ugima vituhu. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Khahana mntu mnihoka ugima wangu, miye naulavya kwa kukunda kwangu mwenye. Ninao udaho wa kuulavya na udaho wa kuudoa vituhu, mwiko unu nee Tate ekunigombekavyo nigosoe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Wekusikiaho mbui izo kukalawiiya kwepanga vituhu gatigati ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Wangi wao wakamba, “Ana zaiko uyu, naho ni mkiau! Kwa mbwai kumtegeeza?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Wantu watuhu wakamba, “Izi khizo mbui za mntu mwenye zaiko, kwaani zaiko dadaha kugubua meso ya matuntu?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aemewa na Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Uko Yelusalemu nee kuwa na sikukhuu ya kuvugua Nyumba ya Muungu, kisingi icho kiwa cha pheho. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu nae kawa akenda he Nyumba ya Muungu he ukumbi wa Selemani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Wayahudi wakamuikia bunga wakamuuza, “Watibada mwemamaakhanyi adi ini? Ati wee ni Klistu isasa tambie ukwei.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Khiwagombeka kae akini khamwekuzumiiya, ndima nizigosoazo ni kwa udaho wa zina da Tate yangu zanivuhuzia. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Akini nywie khamzumiiya, kwaivyo nywie khio ngoto zangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ngoto zangu zategeeza mgutio wangu, miye nawamanya, nawo wanitongea. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Miye nawekha ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, naho khawana wage kisingi chose, wala khahana mntu mdaha kuwadoa kulawa hangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tate yangu nee mwekunekha awo, ni mkuu kusima wose, naho khahana mntu mdaha kuwadoa he mikono ya Tate. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Miye na Tate ni kintu kimwe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Wayahudi wakadoa maiwe wamtambikie ili wamkome. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu akawamba, “Khiwaonyesha ndima nyingi zilawazo kwa Tate, ni kihi icho kimiekacho mnitoe maiwe?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Wayahudi wakamtambaisa, “Khatikutoa maiwe kwaajii ya ndima ntana, iya ni kwa kumkufuu Muungu! Kwaviya wetenda u Muungu ikawa wee ni mntu du inga wantu watuhu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Iyandikwa mwe miagiiyo yenu kuwa, Muungu kagombeka, ‘Nywie ni miuungu.’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Muungu kawetanga <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miuungu hanu ina mana wantu wose wa Isilaeli</char></note>miuungu wada wekwekhigwao mbui zakwe, tamanya kuwa Maandiko ya Muungu yagombeka ukwei misi yose. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Ivi, mwadaha viivihi kumwamba yuda ambae Tate akamuika kwaajii ya ndima yakwe na kumwagiiya mwe inusi adumuwa? Ivi ni kwaviya khigombeka miye ni Mwana wa Muungu? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Inga khigosoa ndima za Tate yangu, msekunizumiiya. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Akini ati nazigosoa ndima za Tate yangu, ata inga khamnizumiiya, naho zizumiieni ndima izo, ili mdahe kummanya kuwa Tate yuumu mwangu na miye niumo mwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Wakageeza vituhu kumgwiya, akini akahauka gatigati yao.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu akaita khandakhanda ya zigizigi da mazi ya Yolodani, hantu Yohana ekubatiizaho, akekaa uko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Wantu wangi wakambasa wakamba, “Yohana kheekugosoa ntangio yoyose, akini mbui zose za Yesu zia ekugombekazo Yohana neziwa za kwei.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Wantu wangi wekuwaho hantu hada, wakamzumiia Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Ufe wa Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Mntu yumwe etangwae Lazalo, mwenyezi wa Besania, nekawa mtamu. Mntu uyo neakekaa mwe phaamo ya Besania ekuwayo akekaa Maliamu na umbude da Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maliamu nee yuda mwekumsisa Zumbe mavuta ya mzingo mtana na kumhangusa kwa fii zakwe, Lazalo, kakie nee mwekua mtamu. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ivyo awo waumbude Lazalo, Malia na Masa wakaagiiya mbui inu kwa Yesu “Zumbe, mbuyayo umkundisae ni mtamu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu ekusikiaho ivyo akamba, “Utamu unu khio wa ufe iya wendauwatende wantu wamtogoe Muungu na kwa sia iyo, Mwana wa Muungu viyaviya endaatogolwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu kawakundisa muno Masa na Malia maumbude da na Lazalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Yesu ekwembigwaho Lazalo ni mtamu, Yesu akaendeea kwekaa hantu aho ekuaho kwa misi miidi. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Naho akawamba wahina wakwe, “Titeni vituhu mwe si ya Yudea.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Wahina wakwe wakamwamba, “Mhinyi! Kisingi kijihi chekwembokacho tangia Wayahudi wekukundaho kukukoma kwa maiwe, nawe waonda ukuite uko vituhu?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu akawamba, “Ivi saa za musi khio kumi dimwe na mbii? Naho mntu akenda musi khadaha kwekungwaa kwaviya aona ung'azi wa zua mwe inusi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Akini mntu akenda na kio, ekungwaa kwaviya ung'azi khaumo umo mwakwe.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu ekubindaho kugombeka mbui izo, akawamba, “Mmbuya wetu Lazalo kagona akini miye naita nikamwenue.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Wahina wakwe wakamwamba, “Zumbe, inga kagona usisiza, endaenuke.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Wowo wamamakhanya kuwa kagona usisiza, akini Yesu kamanya kae ati Lazalo kauya na nyuma. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yesu akawamba pwii, “Lazalo kauya na nyuma, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />akini natamiwa kwaviya nchekuwa uko ekuuyaho na nyuma Lazalo, ili mdahe kunizumiiya, aya titeni kwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomaso yuda mwetangwa phasa akawamba wahina weziwe “Titeni na swie tiuye na nyuma hamwe nae!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nee ayuyusaye wantu na kuwekha ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu ekubuaho uko, akabwiiya Lazalo kagewa kae mwe mbiya kwa misi mine. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Phaamo ya Besania neiwa hehi, na Yelusalemu uhae ubuwao kilomita ntatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Wayahudi wangi waita kwa Masa na Malia kuwahongeza kwa ufe wa kaka yao.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Naho Masa ekusikiaho Yesu eza, akenda kumhachiiza, akini Malia kasigaa kaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Masa akamwamba Yesu, “Zumbe ati nekuwa aha, kaka yangu kheekuwa auye na nyuma. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Akini namanya isasa chochose wendacho umuombeze Muungu, endaakwekhe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu akamwamba, “Kakio endaayuyuke na kuwa mgima vituhu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Masa akatambaisa “Namanya endaayuyuke kisingi wantu wendaho wayuyuswe, msi wa kisiikizi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu akamwamba, “Miye nee niwayuyusae wantu na kuwekha ugima na mntu yoyose anizumiiyae ata inga kauya na nyuma, endaawe na ugima. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Na mntu yoyose ekaae na kunizumiiya kisingi chose khana auye na nyuma katu, ivi wayazumiiya ayo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Masa akamtambaisa, “Eehe Zumbe miye nazumiiya ati wee nee Klistu Mwana wa Muungu yuda ezae mwe inusi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aiya mesozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ekugombekayo ayo, Masa akenda kumwetanga Malia umbude, akampokosa he ikedu, “Mhinyi yuaha akwetanga.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maliamu ekusikiaho ayo, akenuka kinyio akambasa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu nee khazati kwengia mwe phaamo akini kawa hadahada Masa ekumhokeaho. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Aho, Wayahudi wekuwao hamwe na Malia kwa kumhongeza wamwona enuka na kulawa chongoi kinyio wakambasa, wakimamaakhanya kuwa enda kuiya kwe mbiya.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Naho Malia ekubuaho hantu Yesu ekuaho nakumuona, akakinta mavindi akamwamba “Zumbe inga nekuwa aha kaka yangu kheekuwa akauya na nyuma.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu ekumuonaho aiya, wada wayahudi wekwezao hamwe naye wose wakaiya, akengiwa ni mbazi na kugwidukwa moyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yesu akawauza “Mmwika hahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Wakamtambaisa, “Zumbe soo ukauwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu nee aiya. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Wayahudi wakamba, “Kauwani ekumkundisavyo Lazalo!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Wantu watuhu wakamba, “Ivi nee yuda mwekumgubua meso yuda tuntu? Isasa khekudaha kumtenda Lazalo asekuuya na nyuma?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amyuyusa Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Naho Yesu akawa na usungu vituhu mwe moyo wakwe, akaita he mbiya. Mbiya denye nediwa phanga, nado digubikwa kwa iwe kuu. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu akawamba, “Usani ido iwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Masa umbude da uyo mwekuuya na nyuma akamtambaisa Zumbe, “Kwaviya kekaa mwe mbiya misi mine isasa kavoka kae kunukha!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu akawamba, “Ivi ncheekukwamba inga ukanizumiiya wendauuone ukuu wa Muungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Wakadiusa dia iwe, Yesu akakauwa uwanga kwa Muungu akamba, “Nakutogoa Tate kwaviya wanitegeeza uviki wangu. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Namanya inga wanitegeeza kia msi, akini nagombeka aya kwaajii ya wantu awa weaha wadahe kuzumiia ati wee nee mwekuniagiiya” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ekubindaho kugombeka ayo, aketanga kwa mgutio mkuu “Lazalo, lawa chongoi!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Lazalo akalawa chongoi, uku kazengetezwa sanda mwe mwii wakwe, miundi na mikono ifungwa na cheni chakwe kigubikwa leso, Yesu akamba, “Mchopoeni mmweeke aite.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nteganyi ya kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ivyo wayahudi wangi wekwezaho kwa Malia yekuonaho mbui ida ekugosoayo Yesu wakamzumiia. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Akini watuhu wakaita kwa Mafalisayo na kuwagombeka mbui ida ekugosoayo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Kwa ivyo, waviki wakuu na mafalisayo wakawetanga waongoezi wakuu wa Wayahudi wa mkonga na kugombeka “Titende viivihi? Mntu uyu agosoa ntangio nyingi. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Inga tikamwekea aendeee, wantu wose wendawamzumiiye, na awo Walumi wendaweze waibanange Nyumba ya Muungu na kuwakoma wantu wa si yetu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Yumwe yawo etangwae Kayafa, yuda mwekuwa Mviki Mkuu kwa mwaka uda, akawagombeka “Nywie khammanya kintu! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Khammanya ati ni vyedi kumkoma mntu yumwe kwaajii ya wantu, kusima wantu wose wa si ngima wadagamiye?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kheekugombeka akundavyo mwenye, kwaviya kawa Mviki Mkuu kisingi icho, nee kamanya Yesu endaauye na nyuma kwaajii ya si yawo, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />na khio kwaajii ya si iyo ya Wayahudi iya ni kwaajii ya wantu wa Muungu wekumwaganikao ili kuwaeta hamwe na kuwatenda kuwa kintu kimwe.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Nee kuvokea msi uwo, waongoezi wa Kiyahudi wakaondeza kintu chendacho kiwatende wamkome Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ivyo Yesu khekuita vituhu hemeso ya Wayahudi iya akalawa aho, akaita hehi na kiwawe, he mzi wetangwao Eflaimu, akekaa uko hamwe na wahina wakwe.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Sikukhuu ya Wayahudi ya pasaka iwa hehi na wantu wangi wakaita Yelusalemu wadahe wezingue hemeso ya Muungu kabla ya sikukhuu iyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Wantu nee wakamuondeza Yesu, nawo wekukintanaho hantu he Nyumba ya Muungu wakauzana, “Ivi mntu uyu khanaeze he sikukhuu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Waviki wakuu na Mafalisayo nee walavya miko kuwa mntu akamanya hantu Yesu eiho, awatonye wadahe kumgwiya.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Maliamu amwetiiya Yesu mavuta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Misi mtandatu nee khaizati sikukhuu ya Pasaka, Yesu akaita Besania ekuwako akekaa Lazalo, yuda ambae Yesu ekumyuyusaye. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Uko wakamuiikia khande ya guoni, Masa nee mwekuwa akawagosweea ndima, na Lazalo kawa yumwe wa wada wekuwao wekaa hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Aho, Malia akadoa hindi ya mavuta ya mzingo mtana yekugosolwayo na nalido na ya yombe khuu, akamwetiiya Yesu mwe miundi na kumhangusa kwa fii zakwe, nyumba yose ikamema mzingo mtana wa mavuta. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yuda wa Isikaliote, yumwe wa wada wahina kumi dimwe na mbii nauyo nee mwenda amhituke Yesu akamba, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Kwa mbwai ayo mavuta yenye mzingo mtana yasekutagwa kwaviya nee tikadaha kupata hea za kuiha mtu maiho yakwe ya mwaka mgima na hea iyo tikawekha wakiwa?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Kagombeka ivyo, khio kwa kuwaonea mbazi wakiwa, iya kwaajii yee nekawa na mkwiji wa hea na nee mbavi. Maa kwa maa nee akadoa hea na kuzida ikedu.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Naho Yesu akagombeka, “Mwesekumpisha mvyee uyu! Kwaviya kanetiiya mavuta aya kwaajii ya msi wangu wa kugewa mwe mbiya. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Wakiwa mnawo misi yose, akini miye khamna muwe nami misi yose.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nteganyi ya kumkoma Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Wayahudi wangi wasikia Yesu kawa Besania, ivyo wakaita uko khio kwaajii ya Yesu iya kumuona Lazalo yuda ekuyuyuswae na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Viyaviya waviki wakuu wakagosoa nteganyi ya kumkoma Lazalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kwaajii ya kuyuyuswa kwa Lazalo, Wayahudi wangi wakawahituka waongoezi wao, wakamzumiia Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu engia Yelusalemu kwa nyemi khuu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Kioi dakwe zumwezumwe khuu da wantu wakeza kwe sikukhuu, wasikia Yesu kawa siai eza Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Nee wadoa matambi ya mitende madodo dodo, wakalawa kwa kumhachiiza, wakatoa mgutio wakamba, “Ntunyo! Ajaiwe uyo mweza kwa udaho wa zina da Zumbe, ajaiwe Seuta wa Isilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu nekapata mwanaphunda akamkwea uwanga inga viya yekuandikwavyo mwe Maandiko ya Muungu,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Mwesekuogoha ee wantu wa mzi wa Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Kauwa Seuta wenu eza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Kakwea mwana phunda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Kisingi icho wahina wakwe khawekuzimanya mbui izo, akini Yesu ekutogolwaho, nee wakumbuka Maandiko yekuandikwayo uwanga yakwe na wantu wamgosweeya ivyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Zumwezumwe da wantu wekuwao hamwe na Yesu kisingi ekumwetangaho Lazalo kulawa mwe mbiya, na kamyuyusa kulawa kwa wekufao nee wa mvuhuzia. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Kwa ivyo zumwezumwe ido da wantu, wakamhachiiza kwaviya wose wasikia ntangio iyo, kuwa Yesu kamyuyusa Lazalo. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Mafalisayo wakaambizana “Mwaona khatidaha kugosoa chochose vituhu! Kauwani inusi ngima wantu wose wamtongea yee!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamwe wa Wagiiki wakunda kumwona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Nekuwa na Wagiiki wekuawo wabua Yelusalemu kuvika kisingi cha sikukhuu ya pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Awo wakamtimia Fiipo mwenyezi wa Betisaida wa mzi wa Galilaya, wakamba, “Mkuu taombeza kumwona Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Fiipo akaita akamwamba Andulea, aho wose waidi wakaita kumwamba Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu akawamba, “Saa ya kutogolwa muno miye Mwana wa Mntu ibua. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Nawamba ukwei, mbeyu ya ngano yasigaa mbeyu ikesekugwa, akini ikagwa ahosi na kufa, ati ikafa, aho yavyaa matunda mangi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Mntu yoyose akundisae ugima wakwe endaawaze, akimae ugima wakwe mwe inusi, endaauike kwaajii ya ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Mntu akundae kunigosweeya ndima akundigwa anitongee, ili awe na miye kia hantu niitako, viyaviya mntu akanigosoeya ndima, Tate yangu endaamwekhe ntunyo.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agombeka mbui ya ufe wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Isasa moyo wangu wasuumia muno, nigombeke mbwai? Ivi nigombeke, ‘Tate, nakuombeza unihonye kisingi iki cha masuumizo?’ Khivyo khidaha kugombeka akini ni kwaajii ya ayo nee kiekacho nibwiiye mda unu. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tate, uditogoe zina dako!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Aho ukalawa mgutio kulawa uwanga kwa Muungu ukamba, “Khiditogoa zina dako na nendaniditogoe vituhu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Akini zumwezumwe da wantu wekuwao hantu hada wasikia mgutio uwo, nawo wakagombeka, uwo ni mgutio wa tuntumo, na wantu watuhu wakamba, “Mndima wa uwanga kwa Muungu katamwiiya na Yesu!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yesu akawamba, “Mgutio uwo utegeezeka khio kwaajii yangu, iya ni kwaajii nywie mumzumiiye Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Isasa ni kisingi cha inusi kuamuiiwa, mkuu wa mwe inusi endaasigwe chongoi. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Nendaho nenulwe uwanga kulawa mwe inusi, nendaniwetange kia yumwe eze kwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Kwa kugombeka ivyo, Yesu kamanya endaauye na nyuma viivihi.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Naho zumwezumwe ido dikamtambaisa, “Swie tisoma mwe Miagiiyo kuwa uyo Klistu endaekae kisingi chose kwesiho kisiikizi, wadaha viivihi kugombeka Mwana wa Mntu akundigwa enulwe? Uyo Mwana wa Mntu ni ndai?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu akawamba, “Un'gazi wendauwe na nywie kwa mda mjihi, endani mke na uwo un'gazi ili kiza kisekuwavota, kwaviya endae na kiza khamanya aitako. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Kisingi mke na uwo ung'azi, uzumiiye ili mdahe kuwa wantu wa ung'azi.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Wantu khawazumiiya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu ekugombekaho mbui izo akenda kwefisa hae nawo. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Etiho Yesu kagosoa ntangio vyose hemeso yawo, wowo khawekumzumiiya, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Inu neiwa ili kuiganiza ida mbui yekugombekwayo na Muoni wa Muungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Zumbe ni ndai mwekuzumiia mbui zetu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Naho Zumbe kumgubuiya ndai udaho wakwe?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ivyo khawekudaha kumzumiia Yesu, kwaviya Muungu kagombeka hantu hatuhu kwembokea muoni yakwe Isaya,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Muungu kawatenda wasekuona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Kawatenda wasekuva kwa mioyo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Wasekukauwa kwa meso yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Wasekumanya kwa akii zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Naho wasekunihitukia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Ili nidahe kuwahonya, agombeka Zumbe.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya kagombeka mbui izi kwaajii ya ukuu uwo wa Yesu, akamba mbui zakwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Na ivyo waongoezi wangi wa kiyahudi wamzumiiya Yesu, akini khawekugombeka pwii kuwa wamzumiiya kwa kuogoha kuguuswa mwe Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Waongoezi awo wa Wayahudi nee wakakundisa muno kutunywa ni wantu kusima kutunywa na Muungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu keza kuohowa wantu wa inusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Naho Yesu akagombeka kwa mgutio mkuu, “Mntu mnizumiiya miye, khanizumiiya miye du, iya amzumiiya viyaviya yuda mwekunigiiya. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Mwekuniona miye kamuona yuda mwekuniagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Miye ni ung'azi, nami ncheza mwe inusi, ili wose wamzumiiao wasekusigaa mwe kiza. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Mntu yoyose ategeezae mbui zangu akini khazitozeeza, miye khinanimuamwiiye, mana ncheekweza kwaajii ya kuamuiiya inusi iya kuiohoa. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Akini wose wekuniemeao miye na kuemea mbui yangu, wendawaamuiwe mwe msi uda wa kisiikizi, kwa mbui ya kwei nekugombekayo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Miye ncheekugombeka kwa mwiko wangu mwenye iya khigombeka yada ekunekhayo Tate. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Miye namanya miko yakwe yaeta ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi. Miye nagombeka du yada Tate ekuniagiiyao niyagombeke.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu asunta wahina wakwe miundi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Neiwa msi nee khaizati kubua sikukhuu ya Pasaka. Yesu akamanya mda wakwe wa kuhauka mwe inusi kuita kwa Tate nee ubua kae. Nee kawakundisa misi yose wantu wakwe wekaao mwe inusi, naho nee kawakundisa muno kwesiho mihaka.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Nee Yesu na wahina wakwe wawa wekaa kuda khande ya guoni, Ibiisi kamgeya kae Yuda mwana wa Simoni Isikaliote moyo wa kumhituka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu akamanya kuwa Tate kaika vintu vyose asi ya udaho wakwe, na kuwa nee kalawa kwa Muungu na endaagotoke kwa Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Aho Yesu akagooka, akaika khandai gwanda dakwe da chongoi, akadoa ntii kitambaa na kwefunga mwe kigudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Naho, akagea mazi mwe wiga, akavoka kuwasunta wahina wakwe miundi na kuihangusa kwa kitambaa ekwefungacho mwe kigudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Aho, akamtimia Simoni Petulo, nae Petulo akamba, “Zumbe wee wendaunisunte miundi miye?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Khumanya nigosoacho isasa, akini wendaumanye kisingi chezaho.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petulo akamwamba Yesu, “Wee khunaunisunte miundi katu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu akamtambaisa, “Nikesekukusunta khaunauwe yumwe wa wantu wangu kisingi chose.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petulo akamtambaisa, “Zumbe nisunta, khio miundi du, ata na mikono yangu na viyaviya mtwi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu akamwamba, “Mwekwehaka kae mazi khakundigwa kwehaka vituhu, iya akundigwa kusunta miundi du kwaviya kang'aa mwii wose, nywie mng'aa akini khio nyose.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu akamanya yuda endaeamhituke nee mana kagombeka, “Nywie msuntika, akini khio nyose.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ekubindaho kuwasunta miundi na kwehasika vituhu gwanda dakwe, akekaa he meza hantu hakwe, akawauza, “Ivi mniva ivyo nekuwagosoeacho?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />“Nywie mwanetanga Mhinyi na Zumbe, nanywi mwagombeka vyedi, kwaajii ni miye. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Naho, ikawa miye Zumbe na mhinyi khimisunta miundi, nywie nanywi mwakundigwa mgosoeane ivyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Khiwekha msimo unu, ili nanywi mgosoe inga nekuwagosweeavyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Nawagombeka ukwei, mndima khio mkuu kusima mkuu yakwe, wala mwagiiwa khio mkuu kusima yuda mwekumuagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Naho, ikawa mwayamanya ayo, mwendamjaiwe.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Aya nigombekayo ni kwa nywie nyose, miye nawamanya wada nekuwasaguwao. Akini yakundigwa yaiganie Maandiko ya Muungu yagombekavyo, ‘Yuda mwekuda khande hamwe na miye kanihituka.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Miye nawamba mbui izi isasa umo khayazati kulawiiya, ili yalawiaho mdahe kuzumiia kuwa, ‘Miye Nee Uyo.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Nawamba ukwei, amuhokeae yuda nimuagiiye anihokea miye, na anihokeae miye amhokea yuda mwekuniagiiya.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agombeka mbui ya kuhitukwa kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu ekugombekaho ayo, moyo ukamuuma, akagombeka pwii, “Nawamba kwei, yumwe yenu endaanihituke.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Wahina wakwe wakakauwana, kwaviya khawekumanya amgombeka ndai. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Mhina yumwe yuda Yesu ekuae amkundisa muno, nee kekaa hehi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Petulo akamhungia mkono na kumwonyesha utangio, na kugombeka, “Muuze amgombeka ni ndai.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Mhina uyo akesogeza hehi na Yesu akamuuza, “Zumbe ni ndai?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Yuda nendaenimwekhe kibendu cha bumunda, nekukigintacho mwe wiga, nee uyo.” Akadoa kibendu cha bumunda, akakiginta mwe wiga, akamwekha Yuda mwana wa Simoni wa Isikaliote. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda wa Isikaliote ekubindaho kuhokea kia kibendu cha bumunda Ibilisi akamwengiya. Aho Yesu akamwamba, “Ukundacho kukigosoa kigosoe kinyio.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Akini khakuna katu yumwe wa wada wekwekaao he meza mwekumanya kwa mbwai kagombeka ivyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwaviya Yuda kawa mwiika hea, watuhu wakamamakhanya, Yesu kamwamba ague vyekukundigwavyo mwe sikukhuu, hambu kamwamba alavye chochose kwa wakiwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yuda wa Isikaliote ekuhokeaho kia kibendu cha bumunda, akalawa chongoi kinyio, neiwa kiza.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwiko mhya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Naho Yuda kisingi kalawa chongoi, Yesu akawamba wahina wakwe akagombeka, “Isasa ukuu wangu miye Mwana wa Mntu uhehi kuoneka pwii. Naho wendauoneke pwii ukuu wa Muungu kwembokea mwe ntendwa zangu. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Mwana endaawaonyeshe wantu, Muungu ekuwavyo mkuu, naho Muungu endaawaonyeshe wantu viya Mwana ekuwavyo mkuu. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Wanangu nikeaho na nywie kwa mda mjihi du. Mwendamniondeze akini isasa nawamba yada nekuwagombekayo waongoezi wa Kiyahudi, ‘Niitako nywie khamdaha kuita.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Nawekha mwiko mhya, kundisaneni inga viya niwakundisavyo nywie, na nywie kundisaneni. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Mkakundisana, wantu wose wendawamanye nywie ni wahina wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atamwiiya kuwa Petulo endaamuemee</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petulo akamuuza, “Waita kuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu akatambaisa, “Niitako khudaha kunitongea isasa, akini wendaunitongee kisingi chezacho.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petulo akamwamba, “Kwambwai isasa khidaha kukutongea? Ntayali kuuya na nyuma kwaajii yako.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Ivi kwei wadaha kuuya na nyuma kwaajii yangu? Nakwamba zogoo khadizati kukema, wendauniemee maa ntatu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu nee sia ya kuita kwa Tate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu akawamba, “Mwesekugwidukwa mwe mioyo yenu, mwamzumiiya Muungu, mnizumiie na miye viyaviya. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Kaya mwa Tate yangu mna vyekao vingi, ati nee khayekuwa ivyo nee khiwamba kae, isasa naita kuwaikia hakwekaa. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Na nikaita kuwaikia hantu ha kwekaa, nendaniuye niwadoe na nywie muwe hada neiho. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Sia ya kuita uko, nywie mwaimanya.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomaso akamuuza, “Zumbe uitako khatikumanya, tadaha vivihi kuimanya iyo sia?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu akatambaisa, “Miye ni sia na kwei na ugima, khahana mntu adahae kuita kwa Tate kwesiho kwembokea kwa miye. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ati nee mwanimanya miye nee mkammanya na Tate yangu, kuvokea isasa mwammanya naho mmuona kae.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo akamwamba, “Zumbe Tionyeshe Tate du, na swie nee tikundacho!”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Nchekaa na nywie kisingi chose iki, nawe Filipo khauzati kunimanya? Mwekuniona miye kamuona Tate, wadaha viivihi kugombeka, ‘Tionyeshe Tate?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ivi, khaunizumiiya ati miye niumo mwa Tate, nae Tate yuumu mwangu? Mbui niwagombekeazo khizigombeka inga nikundavyo miye, iya Tate mweumo mwangu agosoa ndima yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mwakundigwa mnizumiie nigombekayo miye niumo ndani ya Tate na Tate yuumu mwangu, inga khivyo, zumiiyani kwa ndima nizigosoazo. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Nawamba ukwei, anizumiiae endaagosoe mbui nizigosoazo miye, naho endaagosoe makuu muno kwaviya naita kwa Tate. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Chochose muombezacho kwa zina dangu ido nendanigosoe, ili Tate atogolwe ekuwavyo mkuu kwembokea Mwanawe. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Chochose mniombezacho kwa udaho wa zina dangu nendanimigoswee.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agombeka endaawaetee Muye wa Muungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Inga nee mkanikundisa mwenda mtoze miko yangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nendanimuombeze Tate, nae endaawekhe mwaambiza mtuhu endaeekae na nywie kisingi chose. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Muye unu endaawagubuie wantu ukwei. Wantu wa inusi ambao wamuemea Muungu khawadaha kumhokea Muye uyo, kwaajii khawamuona naho khawammanya, akini nywie mwammanya Muye wa Muungu, kwaajii ekaa hamwe na nywie naho endaawe ndani yenu.”<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Khinanimibade nywie ikedu, nendaneze vituhu kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Hasigaa hadodo wantu wa mwe inusi khawana wanione vituhu, akini nywie mwendamnione kwaviya miye ni mgima, na nywie nanywi mwendamuwe wagima.” <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Msi uda wendaho ubue, mwendammanye miye niumo mwa Tate, na nywie muumo mwangu na miye viyaviya niumo mwenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Yuda ahokeao miko yangu na kuitongea, yee nee mnikundisa. Anikundisae miye endaakundwe ni Tate yangu, na miye nendanimkundise na nendanimtende animanye.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda, akini khio Yuda Isikaliote akamwamba, “Zumbe yendaidahike viivihi kutitenda swie tikumanye na khio wantu wa inusi wesaokukuzumiiya wee, wakumanye?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu akatambaisa, “Mntu yoyose anikundisae endaatoze mbui yangu na Tate yangu endaamkundise, miye na Tate tendateze kwakwe na kwekaa nae. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Mwesaekunikunda khatoza mbui zangu. Na mbui mwekutegeezayo khio yangu, iya ni yakwe Tate mwekuniagiiya.”<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Nawamba mbui izi, nike hamwe na nywie. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Akini uyo Mwaambizi, nee Muye wa Muungu ambae Tate endaamuagiiye kwenu kwa udaho wa zina dangu, endaawahinye kia kintu na kuwakumbusa yose nekugombekayo.”<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Nawabadia uivanisi, ni uivanisi ulawao kwangu, khio uivanisi inga uda ulawao kwa wantu wa inusi, ivyo mwesekwepisha mwe mioyo yenu, naho mwesekuogoha kintu chochose. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mtegeeza kae, nikawamba, ‘Naita nikaukaaho nagotoka vituhu.’ ” Inga nee mkanikundisa, nee mkatamiwa kwaviya naita kwa Tate kwaviya yee ni mkuu kusima miye. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nawamba aya isasa khayazati kulawiiya, aho yendaho yalawiiye, mdahe kuzumiia. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Khinanigombeke na nywie vituhu, mbui nyingi mana mkuu wa inusi atimia kwangu, iya khana udaho kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Akini wantu wa inusi wakundigwa kumanya inga namkundisa Tate, nee vyeekavyo nagosoa kia kintu inga Tate ekuniagiiyavyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Gookani tihauke aha.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu nee Mzabibu wa kwei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Yesu akagombeka “Miye ni mzabibu wa kwei, na Tate yangu nee muimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kia tambi desado kuvyaa matunda yee adiusa, na kia tambi divyaado adisengeasengea didahe kuvyaa vitana. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Nywie msuntwa kae na msuntwa kwaajii ya mzumiiya mbui zangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ekaani ndani yangu, nami nekae ndani yenu inga viya tambi desavyo kudaha ikedu kuvyaa matunda dikesekusigaa he mzabibu, ivyoivyo khamdaha kugosoa yada akundayo Muungu kwesiho kusigaa umu mwangu.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Miye ni mzabibu, na nywie ni matambi, ekaaye umu mwangu, na miye nekaa umo mwake, uyo avyaa matunda mangi, kwaviya kwesiho miye khamdaha kugosoa chochose. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mntu yoyose mwesaekwekaa ndani yangu, atambikwa chongoi inga tambi ditambikwavyo chongoi, adi dinyae. Wantu wadidodoa tambi inga ido na kuditambika mwe moto dihye. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mkekaa umu mwangu na mbui zangu zikekaa mwenu, ombezani chochose mkundacho nanywi mwendamwekhigwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Wantu wendawammanye Tate yangu endaatogolwe ekuwavyo mkuu inga mkagosoa mbui nyingi akundazo Muungu na mwendamuwe wahina wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Inga viya Tate ekunikundisavyo miye, ivyo ndiho miye nekuwakundavyo nywie, ekaeni kwa kuongoewa na ukundiso wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Mkatoza miko yangu nendaniendee kuwakundisa, inga viya miye nekutozeezavyo miko ya Tate yangu ambae aendeea kunikundisa.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Nawamba mbui izi, nakunda nywie muwe na nyemi na miye, inga viya miye niwavyo na nyemi na nywie. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Inu nee miko yangu, kundisaneni inga nekumikundisavyo miye. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Sia khuu muno ya kuonyesha wawakundisa wambuya zako, ni kuuya na nyuma ili wowo wekae. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Nywie ni wambuya wangu mkagosoa niwaagiiavyo. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Nywie khinaniwetange wandima wangu vituhu, kwaviya mndima khamanya agosoado Zumbe yakwe, akini miye nawetanga nywie wambuya, kwaajii nawamba yose nekutegeezayo kulawa kwa Tate yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Nywie khamwekunisagua miye, iya miye khiwasagua na kuwaagiiya muite mkavyae matunda yekaayo, naye Tate adahe kuwekha chochose mkiombezacho kwa zina dangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Naho nawagiiya kia mntu na amkundise mwezie.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa inusi khawawakundisa nywie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Inga wantu wa mwe inusi wakawakima nywie, akini msekujaa idi, wowo wavoka kunikima miye. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Inga nemuwa wantu wa inusi, inusi nee ikamikunda nywie inga wantu wakwe, Akini kwaviya nywie khio wa mwe inusi, iya miye khiwasagua kulawa mwe inusi inu, kwaajii inu wantu wa inusi wawakima. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Kumbukani nekuwambiavyo, ‘Mtumwa khio mkuu kusima mkuu yakwe.’ Ikawa wanisuumiza miye wenda wamisuumize nywie naywi ati watoza mbui zangu, wendawatoze na da kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Akini ayo yose wenda wamigoswee nywie kwaajii ya kunizumiiya miye, kwaviya khawammanya mwekuniagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Inga nchekweza na kugombeka nawo nee khawekuwa na mavigaviga, akini isasa khawadaha kwevunia inga khawana mavigaviga. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Mnikima miye, viyaviya amkima Tate yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Wesekuwa na mavigaviga inga nchekugosoa vihii gatigati yao, yada ambayo khahana mntu yoyose adahae kuyagosoa akini wowo waona yada nekuyagosoayo na wakanikima miye hamwe na Tate yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Nee mana yada yekuandikwayo mwe miagiiyo yao ni kwei, ‘Wanikima buebue.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Nendanimwagiiye Muye wa Muungu alawaye kwa Tate, endaeawaonyeshe ukwei. Muye uyo wa Muungu endaawambize na kuwagombeka miye neivyo. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Na nywie nanywi mwenda mnigombekee, kwaviya muwa na miye kuvokea aho bosi.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Kiwamba ayo kwaviya msekueka kunizumiiya. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Wantu wendawamiguuse nywie he nyumba zawo za kukintania Wayahudi. Naho kisingi cheza kia endaeawakome nywie endaamamakhanye kuwa amgosoea ndima Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Wenda wamigoswee mbui izo kwaviya khawekummanya Tate naho khawekunimanya miye.” <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Akini khiwamba mbui izo ili mda wendahoubue kwa wowo kuwagosoea ayo, mwendamkumbuke kuwa khiwamba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Ndima za Muye wa Muungu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">Nchekuwamba mbui izo, kuvokea aho bosi, kwaviya khiwa hamwe na nywie. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Akini isasa naita kwa yuda mwekuniagiiya na khahana katu mntu yumwe aniuzae, waita hahi? <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Kwaviya khiwamba mbui izo mmema usungu mwe mioyo yenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Akini nawamba ukwei, ni vyedi kwenu miye nihauke, kwaviya nikesekuita mwambizi khanaeze kwenu, akini nikaita uko nendanimwaagiiye kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Nae endahoeze endaawaonyeshe wantu wa mwe inusi mbui ya mavigaviga, na kwa mbui ziya zimtamiazo Muungu na kwa mbui ya uwamuiiyo wa Muungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Waga kwa mbui za mavigaviga kwaajii khawanizumiiya miye, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Mwe mbui ya kumtamiza Muungu, miye khigosoa yamtamizayo Muungu nee mana naita kwa Tate, nanywi khamna mnione vituhu. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Aonyesha pwii kuwa Muungu endaawaamuiye kwaajii kamuamuiya kae Shetani ambae ni muongoezi wa inusi.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Nina mangi ya kuwamba iya kwa isasa khamdaha kuyamanya yose. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Akini endaho auye uyo Muye wa kwei endaawatende muimanye kwei yose ya Muungu, naho khana agombeke mbui zakwe mwenye, iya enda agombeke ekuyategeezayo na kugombeka yendayoyeze. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Yee endaawatende mnitunye, kwaajii endaawambe yada yose endayo apate kulawa kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Vyose enavyo Tate ni vyangu, nee vyekweekacho khigombeka kuwa Muye endaawambe yada yose yalawayo kwangu.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usungu na nyemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Kisingi kidodo khamnamnione, na bada ya kisingi kidodo vituhu mwendamnione.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Aho wamwe wa wahina wakwe wakauzana, “Ambaze? Atambiaho, kusigaa kisingi kidodo khamna mnione na ikemboka kisingi kidodo vituhu mwendamnione? Naho amba, ‘kwaviya naita kwa Tate.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Aho wakaendeea kuuzana, ana mana yani, agombekaho, ‘Kusigaa kisingi kidodo?’ Khatimanya amba mbwai!”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu kamanya ati nee wakoondeza kumuuza, aho akawamba, “Ivi mwauzana kwa yada nekugombekayo, ‘Kusigaa kisingi kidodo nywie khamna mnione.’ Na ikemboka kisingi kidodo vituhu mwendamnione? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Nawamba ukwei, nywinywi mwendamwiiye na kuwa na bwaimbo, akini wantu wa inusi wendawawe na nyemi, mwendamuone usungu, akini usungu wenu wendauhituke uwe nyemi. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Inga mvyee aita kuvyaa mwana, ana usungu kwaajii amanya kisingi chakwe cha maumevu makai kibuwa, akini akabinda kuvyaa mwana, khakumbuka vituhu maumevu ayo, kwaajii ya nyemi ya kuvyaigwa mwana mteke mwe inusi ibua. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Nanywi, isasa mna usungu, akini nendaniwezee vituhu, naho mwendammeme nyemi he miyoyo yenu na nyemi iyo khahana mntu mwendae aiyuse kwenu.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Msi uwo khamna mniombeze chochose. Nawamba ukwei, chochose mwendacho mumuombeze Tate, kwa udaho wangu mwendamwekhigwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Adi isasa khamzati kuombeza chochose kwa udaho wangu. Akini isasa ombezani nanywi mwenda mwekhigwe, ili muwe na nyemi muno.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaivota inusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Khiwamba mbui izo kwa misimo, akini kisingi cheza ambaho khina nigombeke na nywie vituhu kwa misimo iya nendaniwambe pwii mbui za Tate. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Msi uwo, mwendamuombeze kwa udaho wangu na khinaniwambe ati nendanimuombeze Tate kwaajii yenu, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />yee mwenye Tate awakundisa nywie, kwaviya nywie mwanikundisa miye, na kunizumiiya kuwa nalawa kwa Tate. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Miye nalawa kwa Tate ncheza mwe inusi, isasa nahauka mwe inusi inu na kuuya kwa Tate.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Aho wahina wakwe wakamwamba, “Isasa wagombeka pwii kwesiho kugea misimo. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Isasa tamanya kuwa wee wamanya kiya kintu, khahana haja ya kuuzigwa mbui na mntu yoyose, ivyo tazumiiya ati kulawa kwa Muungu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu akawatambaisa, “Ivi isasa twazumiia? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Kisingi cheza, naho kibua kae, ambaho nywie nyose mwendahomumwaganike kiya mntu kwakwe, namiye nabadwa ikedu, aaha akini miye khiko ikedu, mana Tate yu hamwe na mie. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Nawamba mbui izi mdahe kuwa na uivanisi he kuwa hamwe na miye, mwe inusi mwenda mkubwaniswe, akini togwani ni moyo miye khivota inusi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awavikia wahina wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu ekubindaho kugombeka ayo, akenua meso uwanga kwa Muungu, akamba, “Tate ida saa ibuwa! Mtogoe Mwanao na Mwana nae adahe kukutogoa. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kwaviya kumwekha udaho Mwanao mwa wantu wose, ili awekhe ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi, wose wekumwekhao. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi nee unu, kukumanya wee ikedu Muungu wa kwei na kummanya Yesu Klistu wekumwaagiiaye. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Miye kikutogoa mwe inusi nakuwaonyesha wantu ukuu wako, kwembokea ndima wekuniagiiazo nizigosoe. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Isasa Tate unitogoe uwaonyeshe wantu nekuwavyo mkuu kwa uda Ukuu nekuwao nao, kabla ya kuumbigwa inusi.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Khikutenda umanyike kwa wantu wekunekhao kulawa mwe inusi, nee wawa wantu wako, nawe ukanekha wawe wangu naho wagosoa yose wekuwaagiiayo, <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />isasa wamanya kuwa kia wekunekhacho kilawa kwako. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Kwaajii khiwamba yose wekunigombekayo, nawo wakahokea, wamanya kwei kilawa kwako na wazumiiya wee nee mwekuniagiiya.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Nawaombezea awo, nawala khiwaombezea wantu wa inusi, iya nawaombezea wada wekunekhao kwaviya ni wako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Wantu wose nekuwao nao ni wako naho wantu wose ambao ni wako ni wangu na miye kitogolwa na waoneka mwe wada wekunekhao. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Na isasa neza kwako, khimo vituhu mwe inusi, akini wowo wendawaendee kuwa mwe inusi, Tate Muungu! Kwa udaho wa zina dako wekunekhado uwaike pheho wawe kintu kimwe inga swie teivyo hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Nekuaho nawo, miye kiwaika pheho kwa udaho wa zina dako wekunekhado Miye khiwainda naho khahana katu yumwe yawo mwekwaga iya ni yuda mwana mwekwaga, ili Maandiko ya Muungu yaiganie inga yekuandikwavyo. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Isasa neza kwako na kigombeka mbui izo mwe inusi, ili wawe na nyemi muno mioyo yao inga ambavyo miye nekuwavyo na nyemi. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Miye kiwekha mbui yako, naho wantu wa inusi wakawakima, akini wowo wekukuzumiiao khio wantu wa inusi inu, inga viya mie nesivyo wa mwe inusi inu. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Khiombeza uwalavye mwe inusi iya naombeza uwainde na yuda mbanasi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Wowo khiwo wa mwe inusi, inga viya nesivyo wa mwe inusi. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Eee Tate nakuombeza uwazingue kuwa wantu wako wa kwei, kwa sia ya ukwei wako, kwaajii mbui yako nee ukwei. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Inga viya wekuniagiiavyo mwe inusi na miye kiwaagiiya wowo mwe inusi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Miye mwenye nchezingua kukugosoea ndima kwaajii yawo ili wowo nawo wezingue kukugosoea ndima mwe ukwei.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Khiwavikia wowo du, iya nawavikia wose wendao wakuzumiiye kwaawiana na mbui zao. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Naombeza ili wose wawe kintu kimwe, Tate naombeza wawe ndani yetu inga viya wee weivyo ndani yangu miye ndani yako, naombeza wawe kintu kimwe ili wantu wa inusi wakuzumiiye inga wee nee mwekuniagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Miye khiwekha ukuu udauda wekunekhao miye, wawe kintu kimwe inga viya swie teivyo hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Miye niwe ndani yawo nawe uwe ndani yangu, naombeza watendwe wawe kintu kimwe, kwaivyo wantu wa inusi wamanye wee nee mwekuniagiiya naho wawakundisa wowo inga unikundisavyo mie.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Tate naondeza awo wekunekhao wawe hamwe na miye hada neiho, waone Ukuu wangu wekunekhao, kwaviya nee kunikunda, kabla inusi khaizati kuumbigwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Tate Yedi! Wantu wa mwe inusi khawakumanya, akini miye nakumanya, awa nawo wamanya wee kuniagiiya. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Khikutenda zina dimanyike kwao, na nendanitendese kugosoa ivyo, ili ukundiso wenao kwangu uwe umo mwao na miye umo mwao.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu agwiwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu ekubindaho kugombeka ayo, akaita phande ya kaidi ya ngodi ya mazi ya Kedloni, hamwe na wahina wakwe, hantu hada hawa na kamnda. Nae Yesu akengiya umo hamwe na wahina wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, mwekumhituka Yesu, kahamanya hantu hada, kwa viya kia maa Yesu nee wakakintana hamwe na wahina wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yuda akadoa wakhondo wa Kilumi na wagoji kulawa kwa waviki wakuu na mafalisayo, akeza nawo he kamnda, uku watoza mienge, na chemli na vitoanavyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu, kwaviya kavimanya vyose vyendavyo vimbwiiye, akalawa akawauza, “Mwamwondeza ndai?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nawo wakamtambaisa, “Yesu wa mzi wa Nazaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu akawamba, “Nee Miye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yuda mwe kumhituka kagooka aho hamwe nawo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu ekuwambaho, “Nee Miye,” wowo wakauya mgeeka, na wakagwa asi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu akawauza vituhu, “Mwamwondeza ndai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Wowo wakamtambaisa, “Yesu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu akawamba, “Khiwamba kae kuwa nee miye, naho inga mwaniondeza miye, waekeni awa waite.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Yesu kagombeka ayo, ili yalawiiye yada ekugombekayo aho bosi, “Wada wekunekhao nchekumwaza ata yumwe.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Petulo kawa na paange, nee adisoomoa, akamsenga gutwi da kuume mndima wa Mviki Mkuu. Mndima uyo nee aketangwa Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Aho Yesu akamwamba Petulo, “Vuza paange dako mwe safuo dako, ivi nisekudomeya kikombe cha usuumizi ekunekhacho Tate?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Mviki Mkuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Wada wakhondo wa Kilumi na mgookezi yawo na wagoji wa Wayahudi nee wamgwiiya Yesu wakamzengeteza sigi, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />na wakamwegaa kwa Anasi, Anasi ni mkwewe da Kayafa yuda mwekuwa Mviki Mkuu wa kisingi icho. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Uyo Kayafa nee mwekuwamba Wayahudi kuwa, yendaiwe vitana mntu yumwe auye na nyuma, kwaajii ya wantu wose.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amhituka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matayo 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maliko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petulo hamwe na mhina mtuhu wakamtongea Yesu. Uyo mhina mtuhu nee akamanyika kwa Mviki Mkuu, ivyo akengia na Yesu heukumbi wa Mviki Mkuu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Akini Petulo, nee kagooka chongoi hehi na uvi. Naho uyo mhina mtuhu mwekumanyika kwa Mviki Mkuu akalawa chongoi, na akagombeka na mndima wa kivyee mgoji wauvi akamwengiza Petulo ndani. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Mtumwa uyo ya kivyee mgoji wauvi akamuuza Petulo, nawe wee ni yumwe wa wahina wa mntu uyu?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Petulo akamtambaisa, “Khio miye.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Msi uwo nekuwa na pheho na wandima na wagoji nee wagimba moto, naye Petulo akagooka hamwe nawo wakaotea moto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mviki Mkuu amuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Naho Mviki Mkuu akamuuza Yesu mbui ya wahina wakwe na mahinyo yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Miye khigombeka na inusi pwii, kia maa nahinya he Nyumba ya kukintania Wayahudi, na kwe Nyumba ya Muungu na hantu wakintanaho Wayahudi wose, naho ncheekugombeka dodose kwa sii. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Kwa mbwai waniuza miye? Wauze wada wekunitegeezao khiwambaze, wowo wamanya nekuwambiavyo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ekubindaho kugombeka ayo, mgoji yumwe mwekua kagooka hada akamtoa Yesu kofi akamba, ivi wee nee umtambaisavyo Mviki Mkuu?<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu akamtambaisa, ati khigombeka yesayo kutama vuhuzia ivyo vyesavyo kutama, akini ati kigombeka vyedi wanitoeyani?<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Nee Anasi amwegaa Yesu uku kazengetezwa sigi, kwa Mviki Mkuu Kayafa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo agombeka khammanya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maliko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Na Simoni Petulo kawa aho aotea moto, umo wakamuuza, “Ivi, wee ni yumwe wa wahina wakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Petulo akaemea na kwamba, “Khiyo miye.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Yumwe da wandima wa Mviki Mkuu akamba, ni nduguye da yuda mntu mwe kusengwa gutwi ni Petulo, akamuuza, “Ivi miye nchekukuona he kamnda hamwe naye?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petulo akaemea vituhu, akagombeka khio miye, vuupu zogoo dikakema.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Keokeo da mtungaihu wakamdoa Yesu kulawa kwa Kayafa, na kumwegaa kwe nyumba khuu ya mkuu wa Walumi, nawo wadahe kuida sikukhuu ya Pasaka, khawe kwengia mwe nyumba ya mkuu wa Walumi, nee waogoha kwaviya wakengia kwendakuwatende wesekuzumiwa kwe kumvikia Muungu, ivyo newavotwa kugosoa sikukhuu ya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ivyo Pilato akawabasa chongoi akawauza, “Ivi mntu uyu kagosoa masa yani adi mumwete kwangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Wakamtambaisa, “Inga uyu kheekuwa mkoa masa khatekuwa timwete kwako.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato akawamba, “Hayani, mdoeni nywinywi wenye mkamuamwiiye kutongeana na miagiiyo yenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Wayahudi wakamtambaisa, “Miagiiyo yetu yatiemeza kumkoma mntu yoyose.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Wagombeka ivyo, ili vidahe kuigania mbui ekugombekayo Yesu kumanya enda afe vivihi.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilato akengia vituhu mwe nyumba ya mkuu wa Walumi akamwetanga Yesu na kumuuza, “Ivi wee nee Seuta wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu akamtambaisa, izo ni mbui zako mwenye, hambu wantu watuhu wakwamba mbui zangu?<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato akamtambaisa, “Ivi miye ni Myahudi? Wantu wa si yako na waviki nee wekukuetao kwangu. Kugosoa masa yani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Useuta wangu khio wa mwe inusi, ati useuta wangu nee ni wa mwe inusi, wandima wangu nee wakanivunia nisekweza kugwiwa na Wayahudi, akini isasa useuta wangu khio wa aha.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Aho Pilato akamwamba, “Ivi wee u Seuta?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu akamtambaisa, “Weye wamba miye ni Seuta, miye khivyaigwa kwaajii iyo, na kwaajii iyo ncheza mwe inusi kuwamba wantu ukwei na kia mntu azumiiyae ukwei, uyo anitegeeza.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato akamuuza Yesu, “Ukwei ni mbwai?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu aamuiiwa kuuya na nyuma</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maliko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilato ekubindaho kugombeka ayo, akawabasa Wayahudi vituhu chongoi akawamba, “Miye khiona masa yoyose kwakwe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Akini mna mazweeya ya kuniombeza miye kuwavuguiya mfungwa yumwe kisingi cha sikukhuu ya pasaka, Ivi mwakunda niwavugwiiye Seuta wa Wayahudi?<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Aho wakatoa vuzo, “Aah! Khio mntu uyu iya Balaba!” Na yuda Balaba nee kawa mhokaji.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Naho Pilato akaagiiya Yesu adoigwe, atoigwe makoto. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Na awo maasikali wakagosoa kintu inga khofia ya useuta yekugosolwayo na miwa, wakambadika mwe mtwi, wakamvikia gwanda da langi ya zambalau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Wakeza hemeso yakwe na kugombeka “Togoa, Seuta wa Wayahudi!” Wakamtoa vibao.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato akalawa vituhu chongoi, akawamba wada wekukintanao, “Kauwani, namwekhiiza Yesu henu na kuwamanyisha miye khiona masa yoyose ya mntu huyu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Umo Yesu akalavigwa chongoi kevaiya kiya kintu inga khofia ya useuta yekugosolwayo na miwa, na gwanda da langi ya zambalau, Pilato akawamba, “kauwani mntu mwenye nee uyo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Waviki wakuu na wagoji wekumuonaho wakakweza mgutio, “Agong'ondewe he mhamba! Agong'ondewe he mhamba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilato, akawamba, “Mdoeni nywinywi wenye mkamsuumiize, mana miye khiona masa yoyose kwakwe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Wayahudi wakatambaisa, “Swiye tina Miko, na kutongeana na miko iyo akundigwa auye na nyuma kwaviya ketanga Mwana Muungu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato ekusikiaho mbui iyo akaogoha. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Akengiya mwe nyumba khuu ya kiseuta vituhu akamuuza Yesu, “kulawiiya kuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Akini Yesu khee kumwaandua mbui yoyose. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilato akamwamba, “Wee khukunda kutamwiiya na miye? Khumanya kuwa miye ninaudaho wakukuekea naho ninaudaho wa kukugong'ondea he mhamba.”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu akatambaisa, “Wee una udaho uwanga yangu, kwaajii du kwekhigwa ni Muungu, ivyo yuda mwekunekhiiza kwako kagosoa kintu kifyaimi muno.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kuvokeya aho, Pilato akaondeza sia ya kumweekeya, akini wayahudi wakatoa vuzo, “Ukamwekeya mntu uyu, wee khiwe mmbuya wa zumbe mkuu wa Walumi, kiya mntu atendaye kuwa seuta ahigana na seuta wa Wakilumi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Naho Pilato ekutegeezaho mbui izo akamlavya Yesu chongoi akekaa he kigoda cha uamwiiyo hantu hetangwaho “Hantu hekupangwaho maiwe.” Kwa kieblania “Gabasa” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Yekubuwaho saa mtandatu wa musi, msi wa kweika tayali kwaajii ya Pasaka. Pilato akawamba Wayahudi, “Mkauweni Seuta yenu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Wowo wakakweza mgutio, “Mkome! Mkome! Agong'ondwe he mhamba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato akawauza, “uwo nimgong'onde he mhamba seuta yenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Waviki wakuu wakatambaisa, “Swie khatina seuta iya seuta mkuu wa kilumi!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Aho pilato akamgeya Yesu mwe mikono yao agong'ondewe he mhamba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu agong'o ndewa he mhamba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Ivyo wakamdoa Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu ekwenuwaho mhamba wakwe, akalawa kuita hantu he kwetangwaho, “Fufu da mtwi” kwa Kieblania ni Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Aho nee agong'ondewa he mhamba, hamwe nae wawagong'ondea he mhamba wantu watuhu waidi, kia yumwe he mhamba wakwe, yumwe phande ya kuume na mtuhu phande yakwe ya kumoso, na Yesu gatigati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato akaandika kibao akakiika uwanga ya mti wa mhamba nee kiandikwa ivi, “Yesu Mnazaleti Seuta wa Wayahudi” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Wayahudi wangi wasoma kibao icho, mana hada ekugong'ondewaho Yesu hawa hehi na mzi. Naho kibao icho kiwa kiandikwa kwa Kieblania na Kilatini na Kigiiki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Waviki Wakuu wa Wayahudi wakaemea wakamwamba Pilato, “Usekuandika, ‘Seuta wa Wayahudi,’ iya andika, mntu huyu nee kamba, ‘Miye ni Seuta wa Wayahudi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato akawatambaisa, “Nekuandikayo khiyaandika.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Maasikai wekubindaho kumgong'ondea Yesu he mhamba, wakadoa magwanda yakwe wakayapanga mafungu mane, fungu dimwe kwa kia asikai, wakadoa viyaviya na gwanda dakwe, gwanda ido diwa difumwa na kuwa kintu kimwe kulawa uwanga adi asi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Awo masikai wakamamakhanya, “Tisekuitatua iya tiitwee kula yendaiwe ya ndai.” Mbui iyo igosoka ili Maandiko ya Muungu yaiganie, yagombekayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Wapangana magwanda yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">Na gwanda dangu wakaditwee kula.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ivyo nee wekugosoavyo wada maasikai.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Hehi ya mti wa mhamba wa Yesu nee wagooka mami yakwe da Yesu, na mami yakwe mdodo da Yesu na Maliamu mkaza Kileopa na Maliamu wa mzi wa Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu ekumuonaho mami yakwe, na hehi naye kagooka yuda mhina ekumkundisae, akamwamba mami yakwe, “Mmaa uyo nee mwanao.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Akabinda akamwamba yuda mhina, “Kauwa uyo nee mami yako.” Na kuvokeya mda uda mhina akahauka nae kaya kwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ufe wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yesu akamanya kabindiiza ndima yakwe ya uohozi, naho akagombeka ili Maandiko ya Muungu yadahe kuigania, “Naona khiu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Aho nee hana wiga wekumemao divai yekusasayo, akadoa dodoki akadiginta mwe divai yekusasayo, wakaigea uwanga ya lasi, wakamwiikiya mwe muomo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu ekusonaho iyo divai yekusasayo akamba, “Yaigania!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Naho akenamiza mtwi wakwe, akauya na nyuma.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atungwa guha mwe ubavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Iwa Ijumaa msi wa mwaandao, kwaivyo mii isekwekaa mwe mti wa mhamba, kwaajii Msi uwo wa Kuhumwiiza iwa msi mkuu kwa Wayahudi, wakamwoombeza Pilato miundi ya awo wekugong'ondewao he mhamba ibondwe na mii yawo iusigwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Ivyo maasikai wakaita, wakaibonda miundi ya yuda mntu wa bosi na yuda wakaidi wekugong'ondewa he mhamba hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Akini wekumbwiiaho Yesu waona kauya kae na nyuma, ivyo khawekumbonda miundi yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Akini asikai yumwe akamtunga ubavu kwa guha na vuupuu ikalawa phome na mazi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Yuda mwekuona mbui iyo, akawamba wantu ili nywie mdahe kuzumiia, na yada ekugombekayo ni kwei naho amanya kuwa agombeka ukwei. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Mbui iyo igosoka ili Maandiko ya Muungu yaiganie “Khahana katu vuha dakwe dimwe dendado dibondwe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Naho Maandiko ya Muungu matuhu yamba, “Wendawamkauwe yuda wekumtungae.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agewa mwe mbia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Yekusiaho ayo, Yusufu mwenyezi wa mzi wa Alimataya, mwekuwaye mndima wa Yesu etiho kwa sii kwaajii ya kuwaogoha Wayahudi, akaita kwa Pilato na kumuombeza uhusa wa kuudoa mwii wa Yesu, Pilato akamzumiiya, ivyo Yusufu akaita akaudoa mwii wa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Naho Nikodemo, ambae aho bosi kawa kambasa Yesu na kio, akaita hamwe na Yusufu wakadoa mhanganyo wa manemane na ubani yabua kilo makumi matatu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Wantu waidi awo, wakaudoa uda mwii wa Yesu wakauzengeteza sanda hamwe na yada malashi inga yeivyo mazweeya ya Wayahudi he uzisi. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Hada hakugong'ondewa Yesu hawa na kamnda, na mwe kamnda ako hawa na mbia dihya dekusongwado he iwe kuu, ambado khadizati kugewa mntu yoyose. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Kwa ngijangija za Wayahudi za mwaandao wa Msi wa Kuhumwiiza, kwaviya mbia ido diwa hehi, wakaika mwii wa Yesu umo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Mbia ibue</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Keokeo da mtungaihu, msi wa bosi wa juma kukekuwa na kakiza, Maliamu wa kulawa Magidala akaita kwe mbia, akadiona dia iwe diusigwa he uvi wa mbia. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Aho akaguuka kuita kwa Simoni Petulo na yuda mhina mtuhu Yesu ekuaye kamkundisa muno akawamba, “Wamuusa Zumbe he mbia na aho khatimanya wamwiikia kuhi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Ahoaho, Petulo hamwe na yuda mhina mtuhu wakahauka na kuita kwe mbia. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Wose waidi wakaguuka akini yuda mhina mtuhu kaguuka kinyio kusima Petulo, akaongoa kubua he mbia. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Ekwenamaho na kusungiia ndani ya mbia akoona sanda, akini kheekwengia ndani. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Petulo akeza akamtimia, akengia he mbia, umo akaona sanda, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na kia kitambaa ekuzengetewazo Yesu kwe mtwi. Kitambaa icho khachekuikwa hamwe na sanda, kikunjwa na kuikwa hantu ha ikedu. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Naho yuda mhina mtuhu mwekuongoa kubua he mbia, akengia viyaviya ndani akoona na akazumiiya. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Nee khawazati kuva Maandiko ya Muungu yekwambayo kuwa, nee yakundigwa ayuyuke kulawa he ufe. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Naho awo wahina wakauya kaya.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amuawiiya Maliamu kulawa Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliko 16:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Maliamu kawa kagooka chongoi ya mbia aiya, uku akekwiiya nee enama na kusungiia he mbia, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />akaona wandima wa uwanga wa Muungu waidi, wekuvaawo magwanda yekung'aayo muno, wekaa hada wekuwaho mwii wa Yesu ugonezwa yumwe he mtwi, wa kaidi he miundi. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Awo wandima wa uwanga wa Muungu wakamuuza, “Mmaa kwa mbwai waiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Nae akawatambaisa, “Wamuusa Zumbe yangu na khimanya wekumwiikako!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ekugombekaho ayo, akahituka mgeeka akamuona Yesu kagooka aho, akini kheekumtanga inga ni Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu akamuuza, “Mmaa waiya mbwai? Wamwoondeza ndai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Maliamu akamamakhanya uyo nee mgookezi wa kamnda akamwamba, “Mkuu inga ni weye mwekumuusa, nambia wekumwiikako, nami ninda nimdoe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu akamwetanga, “Maliamu!” Nae Maliamu akamhitukia Yesu na kumwamba kwa Kiebulania, “Laboni” mana yakwe, “Mhinyi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu akamwamba, “Usekunitoza khizati kuita uwanga kwa Tate, akini uite kwa wandugu zangu ukawambe, naita uwanga kwa Tate yangu na Tate yenu, Muungu yangu na Muungu yenu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Ivyo Maliamu wa mzi wa Magidala akaita kuwamba wada wahina kuwa kamuona Zumbe na kuwa nee kamwamba ivyo.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalawiiya wahina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Nee iwa guoni wa msi uwo wa bosi wa juma, wahina wa Yesu, wakakintana hamwe mwe nyumba, na nyuvi nee zivugalwa kwaajii ya kuwaogoha waongoezi wa Kiyahudi. Aho Yesu akeza akagooka gati yawo akawamba, “Uivanisi uwe kwenu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ekugombekaho ivyo, akawaonyesha mikono yakwe na mbavu zakwe, aho wahina wakwe wakawa na nyemi muno kwaviya wamuona Zumbe. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu akawamba vituhu, “Uivanisi uwe hamwe nanywi, inga viya Tate ekuniagiiavyo miye, na miye nawaagiiya nywinywi.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ekugombekaho ayo, akawavuziya muye na kuwamba, “Hokeani Muye wa Muungu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Inga mwawaekea wantu mavigaviga yao Muungu endaawaekee na inga mkese kuwaekea wantu mavigaviga yao, Muungu khana awaekee mavigaviga yao.<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomaso, yumwe wa wada kumi dimwe na waidi etangwae zina tuhu mpasa kheekuwa hamwe nae kisingi Yesu ekwezaho. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Aho wada wahina watuhu wakamwamba, “Timwoona Zumbe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Akini Tomaso akawamba, “Nikesekuona alama za misumai mwe mikono yakwe na kugeya chaa changu he khovu izo na kugeya mkono wangu he ubavu wakwe, khinanizumiiye.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Yekwembokaho misi nane, wahina wakwe wawa hamwe umo ndani, na Tomaso kawa hamwe nawo, akeza Yesu akagooka gatigati yawo, uku nyuvi ziwa zivugalwa akamba, “Uivanisi uwe nanywi.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Naho akamwamba Tomaso, “Ete chaa chako aha uikauwe mikono yangu, ete mkono wako wembose he ubavu wangu usekuwa na maatu iya zumiiya.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomaso akamtambaisa, “Weye ni Zumbe yangu naho weye ni Muungu yangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu akamwamba, “Ivi kuzumiia kwaajii kuniona? Ebae wada wesaokuona akini wazumiiya.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbui zikundigwazo na kitabu iki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu kagosoa hemeso ya wahina wakwe ntangio ntuhu nyingi khazekuandikwa mwe kitabu iki. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Akini izi ziandikwa mdahe kuzumiia inga Yesu ni Klistu Mwana wa Muungu na kwa kuzumiiya mdahe kuwa na ugima wa misi yose kwesiho kisiikizi.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awalawiiya wahina mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Yekwembokaho ayo, Yesu akawalawiiya vituhu wahina wakwe, khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi da Tibelia na idoido nado nee tondondoo da mazi da Galilaya na nee yekuwavyo, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petulo na Tomaso etangwae phasa na Nasanaeli mwenyezi wa mzi wa Kana ya Galilaya, na wana waidi wa Zebedayo, na wahina watuhu waidi wawa hamwe wose. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petulo akawamba weziwe, “Naita kwekuloa samaki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Nawo wakamwamba, “Tenda tiite hamwe nawe.” Naho wakalawa, wakengia mwe ngaawa, akini kio icho khawekwaambua chochose. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Wekuvokaho kucha, Yesu nee agooka khandakhanda ya tondoo da mazi, akini wahina khawekummanya ati ni yee nee Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Aho Yesu akawauza, “Wambuya wangu, khamzati kupata samaki wowose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Wowo wakamtambaisa, “Bue! Khatizati kwaambua kintu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu akawamba, “Tambikani nyavu zenu phande ya kuume ya ngaawa nanywi mwenda mpate samaki.” Nee wazitambika nyavu akini isasa khawekudaha kubuuta vituhu kwa wingi wa samaki.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Aho yuda mhina mwekuwa akakundiswa ni Yesu akamwamba Petulo, “Uyu ni Zumbe!” Simoni Petulo ekusikiaho ni Zumbe, akevika gwanda da uwanga, mana kheekuwa kadivaa akasooka mwe mazi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Akini wada wahina watuhu watimiya phwani kwa ngaawa uku wabuuta wavu wekumemao samaki, khawekuwa hae na si khavu, iya neeiwa yapata mita mia mwenga kubua khandakhanda ya mazi. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Wekubuaho si khavu waona moto wa makaa ugimbwa, uwanga yakwe kuikwa samaki na bumunda. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu akawamba, “Eteni aha izo samaki wacheche mwekuloazo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Petulo akakwea ngaawa na kuubuuta uda wavu adi si khavu. Nee umema samaki wakuu mia mwenga hamsini na ntatu na etiho wawa wangi, akini wavu khawekudumuka. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu akawamba, “Sooni mde.” Khahana katu yumwe wa wahina mwekugeeza kumuuza wee undai? Kwaviya wammanya ni Zumbe. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu akeza, akadoa bumunda akawekha, akagosoa ivyoivyo na wada samaki.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Inu nee iwa maa ya ntatu Yesu kuwaawiiya wahina wakwe bada ya kuyuyuka.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atamwiiya na Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Wekubindaho kuda, Yesu akamuuza Simoni Petulo, “Simoni mwana wa Yohana, Ivi wanikundisa kusima awa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Naye akatambaisa, “Eehe, Zumbe wamanya ati mie nakukundisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu akamwamba, “Wakauwe wanangoto wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Naho akamwamba kakaidi, Simoni mwana wa Yohana, “Ivi wanikundisa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Petulo akamtambaisa, “Eehe Zumbe wamanya kuwa nakukundisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu akamwamba, “Wakauwe ngoto zangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Akamuuza maa ya ntatu, “Simoni mwana wa Yohana! Ivi wanikundisa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Aho Petulo akasuumia mwe moyo wakwe, kwaajii ekumuuzavyo maa ntatu, “Wanikundisa?” Akamwamba, “Zumbe, wee wamanya yose ati miye nakukundisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu akamwamba, “Wakauwe ngoto zangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Nakwamba ukwei, wekuaho mbwanga, kwezoweya kweika mwenye tayali na kuita kokose wekukundako. Akini wendaho uwe mdaa wenda wenue mikono yako na mntu mtuhu endaakufunge na kukwegaa wesakokukunda uite.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Kwa kugombeka ivyo, koonyesha Petulo ufe wakwe wendavyouete ukuu kwa Muungu. Naho akamwamba, “Nitongea.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mhina mtuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Aho Petulo akahituka, akamuona mhina mtuhu yuda ekukundiswae muno na Yesu ambasa, uyu mhina ni yuda kisingi cha khande ya guoni kekaa hehi na Yesu na kumuuza “Zumbe ni yuhi endae akuhituke?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Petulo ekumuonaho yuda mhina akamuuza Yesu, “Zumbe, na uyu vihi?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu akamtambaisa, “Ati nakunda asigae adi nendaho niuye, yakuusu mbwai? Weye yakundigwa unitongee.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Nee mbui iyo ikazagaa gatigati mwa wantu wekumzumiiya Yesu kuwa mhina uyo khana auye na nyuma, akini Yesu kheekumwamba inga mhina uyo khana auye na nyuma, akini kagombeka, “Inga nikakunda asigae adi msi nendaho neze, wakunda mbwai?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Uyo ni yuda mhina mwekuvuhuzia mbui izi na kuziandika, naswi tamanya uvuhuzi wakwe ni kwei.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kisiikizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Naho kuna mbui nyingi ekugosoazo Yesu, ayo inga nee yaandikwa yose dimwe kutongea ntuhu, namamakhanya mwe inusi yenye khavyekuwa vikaiganiya kuviika vitabu ambavyo nee viandikwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>